Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.37,0:01:01.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,安娜 艾莎\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Anna. Elsa.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.00,0:01:02.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,马上就该睡觉了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Bedtime soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.17,0:01:06.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,公主被雪妖精的邪恶咒语困住了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}The princess is trapped in the snow goblin's evil spell.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.00,0:01:08.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,快 艾莎 做个王子 帅点的\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Quick, Elsa! Make a prince! A fancy one!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.09,0:01:11.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,不好 王子也被困住了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Oh, no! The prince is trapped, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.09,0:01:14.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,在爱情面前 谁还在乎危险\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Who cares about danger when there's love?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.51,0:01:15.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,安娜 我要吐了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Anna. Bleugh!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.85,0:01:18.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,亲亲可不能拯救森林\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Kissing won't save the Forest.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.26,0:01:20.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,迷路的仙子们哭喊起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}The lost fairies cry out.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.35,0:01:22.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,长颈鹿会发出什么叫声\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}What sound does a giraffe make?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.85,0:01:23.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Never mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.52,0:01:25.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,她们唤醒了仙子女王\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}They wake the fairy queen…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.15,0:01:27.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,她打破了咒语 拯救了所有人\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}who breaks the spell and saves everyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.69,0:01:30.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后大家都结婚了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}And they all get married!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.15,0:01:31.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们在演什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}What are you playing?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.32,0:01:32.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,魔法森林\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Enchanted Forest.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.99,0:01:34.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,公主和王子…\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}The prince and the princess…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.20,0:01:36.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,这可不像是我见过的魔法森林\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}That's like no enchanted forest I've ever seen.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.78,0:01:39.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还见过魔法森林\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}You've seen an enchanted forest?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.79,0:01:40.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Wait, what?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.83,0:01:42.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我确实见过一次\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}I have. Once.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.96,0:01:45.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,你居然从来没告诉过我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}And you've never told us this before?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.67,0:01:48.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我现在就可以告诉你们 只要你们…\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Well, I could tell you now, if you…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.75,0:01:50.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 现在就说 - 现在就告诉我们吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}- Now. - Okay, tell us now.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.05,0:01:52.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,你确定要告诉她们吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Are you sure about this?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.88,0:01:54.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,是时候让她们知道了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}It's time they know.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.13,0:01:56.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们之后堆个更大的雪人吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Let's make a big snowman later.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.59,0:01:58.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要她们能坐好乖乖听\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}If they can settle and listen.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.06,0:02:02.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,在很远很远的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Far away…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.27,0:02:04.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,在世界的最北方\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}as north as we can go…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.39,0:02:08.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,有一座很古老的魔法森林\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}stood a very old and very enchanted forest.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.52,0:02:12.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,但它的魔法不是妖精的咒语和迷路的仙子\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}But its magic wasn't that of goblin spells and lost fairies.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.86,0:02:16.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,它被最强大的精灵保护着\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}It was protected by the most powerful spirits of all…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.86,0:02:18.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,风精灵\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}those of air…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.78,0:02:19.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,火精灵\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}of fire…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.87,0:02:21.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,水精灵\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}of water…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.91,0:02:23.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,土精灵\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}and earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.84,0:02:33.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,但那里也是神秘的诺桑德拉人的家园\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}But it was also home to the mysterious Northuldra people.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.55,0:02:35.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,诺桑德拉人也像我一样有魔法吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Were the Northuldra magical, like me?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.88,0:02:38.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 艾莎 他们本身并没有魔法\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}No, Elsa. They were not magical.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.72,0:02:41.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们只是善于利用森林的馈赠\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}They just took advantage of the Forest's gifts.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.14,0:02:45.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们的生活方式与我们大相径庭\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Their ways were so different from ours…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.85,0:02:48.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,尽管如此 他们仍然答应与我们建立友谊\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}but still, they promised us friendship.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.10,0:02:50.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,为纪念两族交好\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}In honor of that,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.52,0:02:52.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们的祖父 鲁纳德国王\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}your grandfather, King Runeard,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.53,0:02:55.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,为他们建了一座坚固的水坝来加固他们的水域\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}built them a mighty dam to strengthen their waters.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.95,0:02:57.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是一份象征和平的礼物\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}It was a gift of peace.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.53,0:02:59.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是一份象征和平的大礼\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}That's a big gift of peace.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.03,0:03:03.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很荣幸能去森林里庆祝大坝落成\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}And I was so honored to get to go to the Forest to celebrate it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.62,0:03:05.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,站直了 安纳尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Stand tall, Agnarr.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.83,0:03:08.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我对于那天将要发生的事情毫无准备\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}I wasn't at all prepared for what the day would bring.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.54,0:03:13.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们卸下了防备\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}We let down our guard.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.17,0:03:16.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们被迷住了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}We were charmed.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.51,0:03:21.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,一切都那么\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}It felt so…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.76,0:03:22.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,魔幻\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}magical.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.86,0:03:38.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,但出了状况\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}But something went wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.03,0:03:42.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们开始攻击我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}They were attacking us.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.91,0:03:43.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,躲到我身后\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Get behind me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.08,0:03:47.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,那场战争很残酷\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}It was a brutal battle.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.00,0:03:50.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们的祖父…\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Your grandfather…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.33,0:03:51.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,父亲\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Father!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.33,0:03:52.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,牺牲了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}was lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.46,0:03:55.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,打斗触怒了精灵\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}The fighting enraged the spirits.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.67,0:03:57.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,当心\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Look out!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.55,0:04:00.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们用魔法来对付我们所有人\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}They turned their magic against us all.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.77,0:04:12.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我听到一个声音\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}There was this voice…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.19,0:04:18.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后有人救了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}and someone saved me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.36,0:04:25.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,据说那些精灵从此消失了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}I'm told the spirits then vanished.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.58,0:04:29.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,浓浓的迷雾笼罩了森林\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}And a powerful mist covered the Forest.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.96,0:04:32.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,让所有人望而却步\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Locking everyone out.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.17,0:04:41.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,当晚 我回到艾伦戴尔 登基为王\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}And that night, I came home King of Arendelle.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.35,0:04:47.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸 那真是太惊人了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Papa, that was epic.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.56,0:04:49.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管是谁救了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Whoever saved you,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.35,0:04:51.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我都爱上了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}I love them.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.56,0:04:53.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也想知道谁救了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}I wish I knew who it was.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.81,0:04:55.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,那些精灵后来怎么样了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}What happened to the spirits?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.69,0:04:57.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在森林里怎么样了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}What's in the Forest now?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.40,0:04:58.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.07,0:05:01.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,迷雾仍未散去\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}The mist still stands.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.45,0:05:02.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有人能进去\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}No one can get in.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.45,0:05:05.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,至今也没有人出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}And no one has since come out.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.28,0:05:06.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我们是安全的\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}So we're safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.74,0:05:07.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.91,0:05:09.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,但森林有可能再次复苏\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}But the Forest could wake again.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.83,0:05:13.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们必须准备好应对随之而来的危机\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}And we must be prepared for whatever danger it may bring.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.67,0:05:15.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,说到这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}And on that note,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.08,0:05:16.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,不如我们跟爸爸说晚安吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}how about we say good night to your father?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.05,0:05:20.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我还有好多问题要问呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}But I still have so many questions.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.30,0:05:22.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,改天晚上再问吧 安娜\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Save them for another night, Anna.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.12,0:05:25.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也知道我没有那种耐心\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}You know I don't have that kind of patience.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.26,0:05:29.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么诺桑德拉人要攻击我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Why did Northuldra attack us anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.01,0:05:31.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁会攻击送礼物的人呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Who attacks people who give them gifts?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.27,0:05:33.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得森林会再次复苏吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Do you think the Forest will wake again?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.65,0:05:38.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有亚托哈伦知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Only Ahtohallan knows.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.69,0:05:40.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,亚托什么玩意儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Octa-who-what?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.11,0:05:44.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我小时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}When I was little…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.70,0:05:46.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我妈妈会给我唱一首歌\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}my mother would sing a song.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.03,0:05:48.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,歌里唱了一条特别的河 叫作亚托哈伦\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}about a special river called Ahtohallan…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.24,0:05:52.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,据说那条河里有所有关于过去的答案\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}that was said to hold all the answers about the past.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.29,0:05:53.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,关于我们身处的这个世界\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}About what we are a part of.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.08,0:05:57.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能唱给我们听吗 拜托\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Will you sing it for us? Please?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.09,0:06:00.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.25,0:06:01.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,相互依偎\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Cuddle close.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.13,0:06:03.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,钻进怀里\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Scooch in.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.14,0:06:13.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 北风与海洋交汇之处 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ Where the northwind meets the sea ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.43,0:06:19.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 有条河流盈满记忆 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ There's a river full of memory ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.77,0:06:24.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 睡吧 宝贝 酣然入梦 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ Sleep, my darling, safe and sound ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.61,0:06:31.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 在这条河里 一切皆明了 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ For in this river, all is found ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.37,0:06:35.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 她的河水 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ In her waters ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.46,0:06:38.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 深邃清澈 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ Deep and true ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.29,0:06:41.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 那里有你追寻的 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ Lie the answers ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.42,0:06:44.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 答案和方向 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ And a path for you ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.30,0:06:48.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 潜入河水深处 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ Dive down deep into her sound ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.80,0:06:54.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 但别太深 否则会溺亡 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ But not too far or you'll be drowned ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.31,0:07:02.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 她将为那些善听之人歌唱 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ Yes, she will sing to those who hear ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.23,0:07:08.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 她的歌里 魔法流淌 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ And in her song, all magic flows ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.91,0:07:14.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 但你能否面对心之所惧 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ But can you brave what you most fear? ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.33,0:07:16.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 你能否正视河流所知的真相 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ Can you face what the river knows? ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.60,0:07:21.48,Title,0,0,0,0,,《冰雪奇缘2》
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.67,0:07:29.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 北风与海洋交汇之处 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ Where the northwind meets the sea ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.55,0:07:35.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 有位母亲满腹回忆 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ There's a mother full of memory ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.97,0:07:40.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 来吧 宝贝 回到故乡 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ Come, my darling, homeward bound ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.85,0:07:43.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 万物皆失之时 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ When all is lost ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.32,0:07:50.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 一切都将明了 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ Then all is found ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.62,0:07:54.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.12,0:07:56.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们准备好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}They're ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.70,0:07:58.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,不好意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.41,0:08:00.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我这就来\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}I'm coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.25,0:08:06.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能听到吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Do you hear that?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.34,0:08:07.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.38,0:08:10.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,没什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Never mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.28,0:08:33.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,喜欢你不会融化的身体吗 雪宝\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Enjoying your new permafrost, Olaf?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.57,0:08:35.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的美梦成真了 安娜\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}I'm just living the dream, Anna.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.54,0:08:38.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我多么希望这一切能永远持续下去\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}How I wish this could last forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.16,0:08:42.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,然而变化却以其别样之美揶揄我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}And yet, change mocks us with her beauty.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.75,0:08:43.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.54,0:08:46.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,原谅我文人附体 成熟令我诗兴大发\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Forgive me. Maturity is making me poetic.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.75,0:08:48.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟我讲讲 你比我年长 理应无所不知\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Tell me, you're older and thus all-knowing…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.88,0:08:50.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有没有担心过\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}do you ever worry about the notion that…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.09,0:08:52.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,万物皆会逝去\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}nothing is permanent?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.93,0:08:54.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.64,0:08:55.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.80,0:08:58.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,迫不及待想长到你这般年龄\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Wow, I can't wait until I'm ancient like you…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.77,0:09:01.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,对重要之事也就不必太过担心了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}so I don't have to worry about important things.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.19,0:09:03.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是这个意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}That's not what I mean.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.94,0:09:05.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不担心是因为\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}I don't worry because…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.81,0:09:10.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我身边有你 艾莎 克里斯托弗与斯文相伴\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}well, I have you and Elsa and Kristoff and Sven…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.44,0:09:11.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有的大门都对我敞开\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}and the gates are open wide…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.24,0:09:13.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我再也不孤单了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}and I'm not alone anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.12,0:09:18.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 没错 风中凉意渐添 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ Yes, the wind blows a little bit colder ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.45,0:09:20.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 我们年龄渐长 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ And we're all getting older ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.25,0:09:25.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 秋日微风轻挪云朵片片 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ And the clouds are moving on with every autumn breeze ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.75,0:09:28.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 南瓜化为田间肥料 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ Peter Pumpkin just became fertilizer ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.34,0:09:31.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 我的树叶平添悲伤与智慧 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ And my leaf's a little sadder and wiser ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.01,0:09:35.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 所以我依赖那些确定的东西 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ That's why I rely on certain certainties ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.93,0:09:39.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 没错 有些事情永不改变 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ Yes, some things never change ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.64,0:09:42.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 就像你我紧握双手 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ Like the feel of your hand in mine ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.02,0:09:44.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 有些事情始终如此 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ Some things stay the same ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.94,0:09:47.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 正如我们美好的友谊 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ Like how we get along just fine ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.11,0:09:50.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 仿佛一堵永不倒塌的旧石墙 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ Like an old stone wall that'll never fall ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.07,0:09:53.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 有些事情永为真理 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ Some things are always true ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.07,0:09:57.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 有些事情永不改变 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ Some things never change ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.57,0:10:01.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 如我紧抱着你 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ Like how I'm holding on tight to you ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.75,0:10:07.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 树叶纷纷落下 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ The leaves are already falling ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.00,0:10:09.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 斯文 这好像未来的召唤 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ Sven, it feels like the future is calling ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.84,0:10:11.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 你是说今晚的你 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ Are you telling me tonight ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.17,0:10:14.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 要单膝跪地吗 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ You're gonna get down on one knee ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.01,0:10:17.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 没错 但我很不擅长策划这些 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ Yeah, but I'm really bad at planning these things out ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.93,0:10:20.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 比如烛光晚餐和拿出戒指的桥段 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ Like candlelight and pulling of rings out ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.81,0:10:25.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 或许你该把浪漫的活儿都交给我 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ Maybe you should leave all the romantic stuff to me ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.52,0:10:29.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 没错 有些事情永不改变 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ Yeah, some things never change ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.11,0:10:31.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 正如我对她的深爱 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ Like the love that I feel for her ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.36,0:10:34.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 有些事情始终如此 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ Some things stay the same ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.36,0:10:36.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 比如与驯鹿相处轻松简单 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ Like how reindeers are easier ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.45,0:10:39.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 但若我真的许下诺言 勇敢一试 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ But if I commit and I go for it ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.32,0:10:42.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 就会知道该说什么 做什么 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ I'll know what to say and do ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.16,0:10:43.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 对吧 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ Right ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.29,0:10:46.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 有些事情永不改变 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ Some things never change ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.96,0:10:51.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 斯文 有压力的事都靠你了 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ Sven, the pressure is all on you ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.63,0:10:56.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 这阵风令人不安 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ The winds are restless ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.43,0:10:59.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 是因此我才听到那呼唤吗 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ Could that be why I'm hearing this call ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.64,0:11:01.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 是否有事发生 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ Is something coming ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.22,0:11:04.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 不确定自己想要改变现状 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ I'm not sure I want things to change at all ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.60,0:11:06.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 这些珍贵的日子 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ These days are precious ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.44,0:11:09.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 可不能轻易溜走 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ Can't let them slip away ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.40,0:11:12.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 定不住这个时刻 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ I can't freeze this moment ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.65,0:11:19.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 但我可以出去 将珍贵时光把握 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ But I can still go out and seize this day ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.34,0:11:34.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 风中凉意渐添 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ The wind blows a little bit colder ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.67,0:11:37.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 大家都越发成熟 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ And you all look a little bit older ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.59,0:11:39.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 是时候在这秋日天空下 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ It's time to count our blessings ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.01,0:11:42.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 享受细碎的幸福时光 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ Beneath an autumn sky ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.76,0:11:45.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 我们的王国永远繁盛 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ We'll always live in a kingdom of plenty ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.60,0:11:48.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 这代表大家的美好心愿 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ That stands for the good of the many ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.19,0:11:52.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 我保证艾伦戴尔之旗将永远飘扬 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ And I promise you the flag of Arendelle will always fly ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.52,0:11:55.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 我们的旗帜将永远飘扬 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ Our flag will always fly ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.28,0:11:59.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 我们的旗帜将永远飘扬 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ Our flag will always fly ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.28,0:12:02.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 有些事情永不改变 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ Some things never change ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.16,0:12:04.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 光阴匆匆 转身即逝 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ Turn around and the time has flown ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.53,0:12:07.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 有些事情始终如此 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ Some things stay the same ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.66,0:12:09.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 尽管未来充满未知 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ Though the future remains unknown ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.71,0:12:12.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 愿我们好运依旧 愿过去已成往事 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ May our good luck last, may our past be past ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.63,0:12:16.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 时光飞逝 这是真理 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ Time's moving fast, it's true ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.80,0:12:20.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 有些事情永不改变 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ Some things never change ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.47,0:12:23.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 如我紧抱着你 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ And I'm holding on tight to you ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.55,0:12:25.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 紧抱着你 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ Holding on tight to you ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.10,0:12:26.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 紧抱着你 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ Holding on tight to you ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.40,0:12:30.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 紧抱着你 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ Holding on tight to you ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.52,0:12:37.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 如我紧抱着你 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ I'm holding on tight to you ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.20,0:12:45.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 狮子吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Okay. Um, lion?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.33,0:12:46.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,灰熊\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Grizzly bear?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.20,0:12:47.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 怪物 - 棕熊\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}- Monster? - Brown bear?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.33,0:12:48.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 怒气脸 - 黑熊\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}- Angry face? - Black bear?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.33,0:12:50.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,汉斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Hans?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.04,0:12:52.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,邪恶怪物\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Unredeemable monster?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.17,0:12:53.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这辈子最大的错误\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Greatest mistake of your life?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.29,0:12:54.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,甚至不愿意吻你\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Wouldn't even kiss you?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.84,0:12:57.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,坏人\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Villain!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.42,0:12:59.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们都猜中了一点点\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}We all kind of got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.67,0:13:00.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 雪宝 该你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Okay, Olaf, you're up.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.92,0:13:01.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.34,0:13:04.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,识字以后感觉这游戏简单多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}So much easier now that I can read.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.85,0:13:07.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,限时回合 男女对抗\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Lightning round, boys against girls.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.56,0:13:09.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 我准备好了 好了 来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Okay, I'm ready, I'm ready. Go.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.35,0:13:12.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,独角兽\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Unicorn.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.31,0:13:13.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,冰淇淋\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Ice cream!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.35,0:13:14.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,城堡 奥肯\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Castle! Oaken!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.11,0:13:16.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,茶壶 老鼠\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Teapot! Mouse!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.23,0:13:18.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾莎\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Elsa!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.19,0:13:22.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,雪宝变形也太赖皮了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}I don't think Olaf should get to rearrange.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.36,0:13:24.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,没关系 我们姐妹的默契也很厉害\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Doesn't matter. This is gonna be a cinch.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.36,0:13:26.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,两姐妹心有灵犀\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Two sisters, one mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.87,0:13:28.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 谢谢 - 来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}- Thank you. - Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.45,0:13:29.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,开始了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Here we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.91,0:13:31.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可以的 艾莎\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}You got this, Elsa.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.08,0:13:33.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,随时可以\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Anytime.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.00,0:13:35.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,用身体语言比划就好\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Just do it with your body.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.58,0:13:36.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,虚无\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Nothing?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.46,0:13:38.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,空气 树木 人群\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Air? Tree? People?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.92,0:13:40.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,树人 不对 没有这么个词\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Treeple? Oh, that's not a word.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.58,0:13:42.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,雪橇男孩 牙齿\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Shovel boy? Teeth?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.80,0:13:43.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,洗碗\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Doing the dishes?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.47,0:13:44.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,北极熊\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Polar bear?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.80,0:13:45.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.93,0:13:47.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,你得给我点提示\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}You gotta give me something.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.26,0:13:51.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,警觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Alarmed?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.48,0:13:52.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,烦乱\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Distracted?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.02,0:13:55.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,担忧 惊慌 焦躁不安\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Worried? Panicking? Disturbed?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.81,0:13:58.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托 你的样子绝对是焦躁不安\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Oh, come on, you definitely look disturbed.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.69,0:13:59.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们赢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}We won.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.11,0:14:01.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,再来一次\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Rematch?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.80,0:14:04.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们知道吗 我准备睡了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}You know what? I think I'll turn in.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.20,0:14:05.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.16,0:14:06.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是…有点累\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Just… Just tired.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.41,0:14:08.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,晚安\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Good night.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.62,0:14:09.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 我也累了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Yeah, I'm tired, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.99,0:14:12.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯文还答应给我讲个睡前故事呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}And Sven promised to read me a bedtime story.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.50,0:14:14.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,是不是 斯文\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Didn't you, Sven?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.12,0:14:15.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Did I?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.00,0:14:17.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,你模仿的声音最棒了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Oh, you do the best voices!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.42,0:14:20.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你假装克里斯托弗说话总是活灵活现 比如\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Like when you pretend to be Kristoff, and you're like…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.00,0:14:21.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,「我需要跟石头们聊聊天\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}"I just need to go talk to some rocks.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.88,0:14:23.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,聊聊童年什么的「\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}about my childhood and stuff."
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.97,0:14:26.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们先讲吧 不用等我了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}How about you guys start without me?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.31,0:14:35.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得艾莎看起来是不是有点奇怪\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Did Elsa seem weird to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.19,0:14:37.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,她看起来就是平常的样子\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}She seemed like Elsa.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.56,0:14:41.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,最后那个词好像真难倒她了 是什么来着\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}That last word really seemed to throw her. What was it?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.57,0:14:43.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我不知道 - 不是 不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}- I don't know. Ahem. - No. No.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.03,0:14:44.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我不知道 但是… - 有了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}- I don't know, but… - Ah.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.49,0:14:46.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,「冰」\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}"Ice"?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.49,0:14:48.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Oh, come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.20,0:14:50.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,她比划不出冰吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}She couldn't act out ice?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.37,0:14:51.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我最好去看看她\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}I better go check on her.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.99,0:14:53.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢 亲爱的 我爱你\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Thanks, honey. Love you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.12,0:14:57.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也爱你\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Love you, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.04,0:15:00.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,没关系\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}It's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.76,0:15:04.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,请进\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Come in.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.51,0:15:08.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,错不了 有心事\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Yep. Something's wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.34,0:15:10.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你吗 - 不 是你\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}- With you? - No, with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.22,0:15:12.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你披着母亲的围巾\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}You're wearing Mother's scarf.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.10,0:15:13.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,你只在有心事的时候这么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}You do that when something's wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.64,0:15:16.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们让你难过了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Did we hurt your feelings?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.23,0:15:17.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果是这样 真抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}I'm so sorry if we did.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.69,0:15:20.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道吗 大家都不擅长玩家庭游戏\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}You know, very few people are actually good at family games.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.19,0:15:21.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是个既成事实\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}That's just a fact.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.19,0:15:23.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是 不是这样的\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}No, that's not it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.53,0:15:25.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是什么事\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Then, what is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.61,0:15:28.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有一种…\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}There's this…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.78,0:15:34.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是不想把事情搞砸\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}I just don't wanna mess things up.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.95,0:15:37.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么事 你做得很好啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}What things? You're doing great.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.67,0:15:41.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾莎 你什么时候才能看到\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Oh, Elsa, when are you going to see yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.33,0:15:43.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我眼中的你呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}the way I see you?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.30,0:15:47.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有你 我该怎么办呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}What would I do without you?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.17,0:15:48.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我永远都是你的后盾\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}You'll always have me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.26,0:15:52.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你需要什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}I know what you need.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.51,0:15:53.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 来吧 过来 - 什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}- Come on, come here. - What?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.89,0:15:54.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,用妈妈的话说\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}In Mama's words,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.89,0:15:57.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,「相互依偎 钻进怀里」\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}"cuddle close, scooch in."
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.44,0:16:03.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 北风与海洋 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ Where the Northwind ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.82,0:16:06.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 交汇之处 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ Meets the sea ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.65,0:16:09.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 有条河流 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ There's a river ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.40,0:16:11.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 盈满记忆 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ Full of memory ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.62,0:16:12.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你想做什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}I know what you're doing.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.45,0:16:17.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 睡吧 宝贝 酣然入梦 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ Sleep, my darling, safe and sound ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.04,0:16:23.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 在这条河里 一切皆明了 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ For in this river, all is found ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.05,0:17:10.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 我能听到你 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ I can hear you ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.26,0:17:12.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 但充耳不闻 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ But I won't ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.88,0:17:14.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 有人惹事 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ Some look for trouble ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.39,0:17:17.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 有人求安 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ While others don't ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.06,0:17:22.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 我有千万理由 继续平凡度日 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ There's a thousand reasons I should go about my day ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.64,0:17:25.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 并忽略你的低语 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ And ignore your whispers ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.02,0:17:28.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 我盼望声音消失 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ Which I wish would go away, oh ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.87,0:17:37.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 你不是话语 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ You're not a voice ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.41,0:17:40.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 只是我耳中的鸣响 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ You're just a ringing in my ear ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.54,0:17:42.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 就算我能听见 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ And if I heard you ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.21,0:17:43.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 我不承认 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ Which I don't ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.42,0:17:45.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 恐怕我已有职责 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ I'm spoken for, I fear ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.83,0:17:50.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 我的所爱之人都在高墙之内 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ Everyone I've ever loved is here within these walls ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.17,0:17:52.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 抱歉 神秘之声 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ I'm sorry, secret siren ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.55,0:17:54.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 但我要充耳不闻你的呼唤 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ But I'm blocking out your calls ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.76,0:17:59.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 我已乘风破浪 无需再多奇遇 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ I've had my adventure I don't need something new ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.06,0:18:03.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 若我跟随你前行 风险令我不安 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ I'm afraid of what I'm risking if I follow you ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.06,0:18:07.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 踏入未知 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ Into the unknown ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.56,0:18:11.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 踏入未知 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ Into the unknown ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.24,0:18:18.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 踏入未知 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ Into the unknown ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.25,0:18:27.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 你想要如何 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ What do you want? ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.67,0:18:31.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 为什么不让我入睡 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ 'Cause you've been keeping me awake ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.30,0:18:33.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 你是为扰我心神不宁 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ Are you here to distract me ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.72,0:18:35.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 让我因此犯错吗 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ So I make a big mistake? ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.68,0:18:40.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 或你真有其人 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ Or are you someone out there ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.81,0:18:43.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 与我境遇相仿 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ Who's a little bit like me ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.35,0:18:46.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 内心深知 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ Who knows deep down ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.14,0:18:49.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 这里不是我的归宿 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ I'm not where I'm meant to be? ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.23,0:18:52.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 每天都愈加艰难 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ Every day's a little harder ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.57,0:18:55.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 我感知力量增长 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ As I feel my power grow ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.07,0:19:00.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 你是否知道我内心深处渴望 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ Don't you know there's part of me that longs to go ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.62,0:19:04.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 踏入未知 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ Into the unknown? ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.95,0:19:09.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 踏入未知 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ Into the unknown! ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.63,0:19:14.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 踏入未知 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ Into the unknown! ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.55,0:19:21.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 你存在吗 认识我吗 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ Are you out there? Do you know me? ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.55,0:19:27.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 感知我心 引领前路 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ Can you feel me? Can you show me? ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.99,0:19:48.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 你去哪里 别弃我而去 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ Where are you going? Don't leave me alone ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.54,0:19:53.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 我要如何跟随你 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ How do I follow you ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.13,0:20:00.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 踏入未知 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ Into the unknown? ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.19,0:20:14.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,风 火 水 土\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Air, fire, water, earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.87,0:20:31.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,水\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}The water!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.30,0:20:43.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,狂风大作 水火消失\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}The air rages, no fire, no water.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.34,0:20:44.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,土紧随其后\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}The earth is next.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.89,0:20:46.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得撤离\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}We have to get out.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.23,0:20:57.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,会没事的 撤退到悬崖去\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}It'll be okay. Evacuate to the cliffs.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.17,0:21:03.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,糟了 我要散架了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Oh, no! I'm gonna blow!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.84,0:21:04.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,有我呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}I've got you!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.73,0:21:15.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 大伙儿都安全撤离了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Yes. Everyone's out and safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.03,0:21:18.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,来 拿一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Here. Take one of these.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.40,0:21:19.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还好吗 雪宝\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}You okay there, Olaf?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.77,0:21:21.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,好极了 我们称这个为\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Oh, yeah. We're calling this…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.66,0:21:25.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,「感觉失控时 掌控手边的事」\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}"Controlling what you can when things feel out of control."
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.42,0:21:26.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 我不理解\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Okay, I don't understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.65,0:21:28.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,你一直听到一个声音\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}You've been hearing a voice.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.22,0:21:30.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,却没想过要告诉我\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}and you didn't think to tell me?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.32,0:21:31.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不想让你担心\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}I didn't want to worry you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.76,0:21:34.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们承诺过要对彼此坦诚相待\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}We made a promise not to shut each other out.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.49,0:21:38.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,就告诉我发生了什么吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Just tell me what's going on.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.25,0:21:42.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我唤醒了魔法森林里的魔法精灵\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}I woke the magical spirits at the Enchanted Forest.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.54,0:21:45.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 我绝对没想到你会说这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Okay, that's definitely not what I thought you were gonna say.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.14,0:21:47.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 魔法森林\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Wait. The Enchanted Forest?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.99,0:21:49.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,父亲警告我们的那个\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}The one Father warned us about?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.98,0:21:50.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,对\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.87,0:21:52.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为什么要这么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Why would you do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.34,0:21:54.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为那个声音\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Because of the voice.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.64,0:21:56.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道这听上去很疯狂\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}I know it sounds crazy…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.42,0:22:00.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我相信呼唤我的是好人\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}but I believe whoever is calling me is good.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.68,0:22:03.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么能这么说 看看我们的国家\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}How can you say that? Look at our kingdom.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.45,0:22:06.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道 只是我的魔法能感觉到\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}I know. It's just that my magic can feel it.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.49,0:22:09.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能感觉到\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}I can feel it.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.05,0:22:10.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.59,0:22:14.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,糟了 现在又怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Oh, no. What now?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.89,0:22:16.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,地精\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}The Trolls?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.44,0:22:20.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,克里斯托弗 我们想你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Kristoff! We missed you!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.32,0:22:20.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,帕比\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Pabbie.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.95,0:22:24.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们两姐妹永远惊喜不断\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Well, never a dull moment with you two.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.50,0:22:27.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我希望你准备好面对自己的所作所为了 艾莎\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}I hope you're prepared for what you have done, Elsa.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.43,0:22:31.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,脆弱的人可无法面对愤怒的魔法精灵\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Angry magical spirits are not for the faint of heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.26,0:22:32.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们为什么还愤怒\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Why are they still angry?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.06,0:22:35.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,这一切和艾伦戴尔有什么关系\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}What does all of this have to do with Arendelle?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.49,0:22:37.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我瞧瞧我能看见什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Let me see what I can see.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.06,0:22:43.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,过去不尽表象所示\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}The past is not what it seems.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.49,0:22:47.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,错误需得到纠正\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}A wrong demands to be righted.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.33,0:22:49.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾伦戴尔不安全\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Arendelle is not safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.49,0:22:53.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,真相必被寻见\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}The truth must be found.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.83,0:22:55.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,否则的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Without it…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.43,0:22:58.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看不到未来\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}I see no future.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.15,0:23:00.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有未来\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}No future?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.68,0:23:03.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果看不见未来\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}When one can see no future…
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.09,0:23:07.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,只能继续做正确的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}all one can do is the next right thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.08,0:23:08.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,继续做正确的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}The next right thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.14,0:23:11.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我前往魔法森林\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}is for me to go to the Enchanted Forest…
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.04,0:23:12.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,并找到那个声音\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}and find that voice.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.70,0:23:15.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,克里斯托弗 我能借用你的车和斯文吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Kristoff, can I borrow your wagon and Sven?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.22,0:23:16.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是很喜欢这个主意\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}I'm not very comfortable with the idea of that.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.66,0:23:18.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你不能一个人去 - 安娜 不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}- You are not going alone. - Anna, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.94,0:23:21.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有魔法保护自己 你没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}I have my powers to protect me. You don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.65,0:23:23.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,不好意思 我可是登上过北山\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Excuse me, I climbed the North Mountain…
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.18,0:23:24.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,遭遇冰冻之心后幸存\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}survived a frozen heart,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.14,0:23:25.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,还从我前男友手中救下了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}and saved you from my ex-boyfriend…
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.53,0:23:26.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且没有魔法就做到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}and I did it all without powers,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.90,0:23:28.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我要一起去\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}so, you know, I'm coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.44,0:23:29.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也是 我来驾车\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Me, too. I'll drive.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.75,0:23:31.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来带零食\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}I'll bring the snacks!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.46,0:23:33.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来照看你的人民\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}I will look after your people.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.55,0:23:34.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,务必确保在我们回来之前\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Please make sure they stay.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.49,0:23:36.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,让他们远离王国\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}out of the kingdom until we return.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.26,0:23:37.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.89,0:23:39.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们去告诉他们吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Let's let them know.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.43,0:23:42.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,安娜 我很担心她\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Anna, I am worried for her.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.43,0:23:43.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们一直害怕\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}We have always feared.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.76,0:23:46.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾莎的能力于这个世界而言太过强大\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Elsa's powers were too much for this world.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.54,0:23:50.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在我们得祈祷她的能力足够强大了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Now, we must pray they are enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.79,0:23:53.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不会让她出事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}I won't let anything happen to her.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.43,0:24:01.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,有谁对冷知识感兴趣吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Who's into trivia?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.35,0:24:03.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我 好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}I am. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.12,0:24:05.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道水是有记忆的吗 是真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Did you know that water has memory? True fact.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.65,0:24:07.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,很多人不相信 不过是真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}It's disputed by many, but it's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.59,0:24:08.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道男人被闪电击中的几率\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Did you know men are six times.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.87,0:24:10.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,要比女人高出六倍吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}more likely to be struck by lightning?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.90,0:24:13.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道大猩猩开心的时候会打嗝吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Did you know gorillas burp when they're happy?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.02,0:24:15.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道我们每天眨眼四百万次吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Did you know we blink four million times a day?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.61,0:24:17.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道袋熊的大便是方形的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Did you know wombats poop squares?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.61,0:24:18.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道在长途旅行中安静睡觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Did you know sleeping quietly.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.75,0:24:21.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以防止精神错乱吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}on long journeys prevents insanity?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.21,0:24:23.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那是假的 - 是真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}- Yeah, that's not true. - It is.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.40,0:24:24.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 真的 - 绝对是真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}- It's true. - Definitely true.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.59,0:24:26.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,是真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}No, it's the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.06,0:24:27.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们还挺一致的\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Well, that was unanimous.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.80,0:24:29.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,但等我回家了会查一查的\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}But I will look it up when we get home.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.24,0:24:33.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们都睡着了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}They're both asleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.23,0:24:37.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想怎么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}So, what do you wanna do?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.23,0:24:42.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯文 稳一点 行吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Sven, keep us steady, will ya?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.01,0:24:45.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,安娜\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Anna.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.33,0:24:47.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,安娜\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Anna?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.11,0:24:48.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,还记得我们第一次这样旅行吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Remember our first trip like this…
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.81,0:24:51.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,当时我说你一定是疯了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}when I said you'd have to be crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.06,0:24:52.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,才会想嫁给一个刚认识的男人\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}to want to marry a man you just met?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.82,0:24:54.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 什么 疯了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Wait, what? Crazy?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.61,0:24:57.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可没说我疯了 你觉得我疯了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}You didn't say I was crazy. You think I'm crazy?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.21,0:24:58.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}No. I did.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.93,0:25:00.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,你…\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}You were…
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.58,0:25:01.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,没疯\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}not crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.85,0:25:02.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,很显然\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Clearly.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.10,0:25:04.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是幼稚\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Just naive.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.89,0:25:08.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是幼稚 是情窦初开 像我以前一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Not naive. Just, uh, new to love. Like I was.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.63,0:25:13.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,情窦初开的人难免会做错事\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}And when you're new, you're bound to get it wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.19,0:25:15.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是说我们在一起注定是错的\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}So you're saying I'm wrong for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.19,0:25:17.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么 不 我不是在说\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}What? No, no. I'm not saying.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.22,0:25:19.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,你错了 或是疯了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}you're wrong, or crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.73,0:25:21.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 克里斯托弗 别说了 - 好主意\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}- Kristoff, stop. Please. - Good idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.98,0:25:23.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我听见了 是那个声音\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}I hear it. I hear the voice.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.72,0:25:24.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}You do?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.67,0:25:27.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,雪宝 醒醒\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Olaf, wake up.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.49,0:25:59.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么…\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}What the…
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.09,0:26:29.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,答应我 我们同进退 好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Promise me, we do this together, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.96,0:26:31.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我答应你\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}I promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.32,0:26:42.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:42.42,0:26:44.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们知道魔法森林\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Did you know that an enchanted forest.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.34,0:26:46.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,是变幻之地吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}is a place of transformation?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.33,0:26:48.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不懂那是什么意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}I have no idea what that means…
Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.14,0:26:49.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我等不及想看看\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}but I can't wait to see.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.85,0:26:53.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,它会把我们变成什么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}what it's gonna do to each one of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:55.55,0:26:56.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}What is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:56.50,0:26:57.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 别推我 - 停下\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}- No pushing. - Stop it.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.03,0:26:59.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,太快了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}It's too fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.78,0:27:00.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,刚才是怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}What was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:02.91,0:27:04.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不 不 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}No. No, no, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:06.97,0:27:08.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们被困住了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}And we're locked in.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.20,0:27:09.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们早就该料到的\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Probably should have seen that one coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.98,0:27:14.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,这座森林真美\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}This forest is beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.37,0:27:43.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,水坝仍然屹立\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}The dam. It still stands.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:43.98,0:27:46.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,它在帕比长老的幻象里出现过\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}It was in Grand Pabbie's visions.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:46.77,0:27:48.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,但为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}But why?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.22,0:27:51.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,不知道 但它依旧完好无损 谢天谢地\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}I don't know, but it's still in good shape. Thank goodness.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:51.19,0:27:52.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.11,0:27:53.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果水坝崩塌了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Well, if that dam broke…
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.37,0:27:55.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,就会掀起巨浪\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}it would send a tidal wave so big.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.30,0:27:58.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,把这片峡湾的一切都冲走\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}it would wash away everything on this fjord.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.02,0:27:59.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Everything?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.33,0:28:01.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,但艾伦戴尔在这个峡湾\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}But Arendelle's on this fjord.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:01.87,0:28:03.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾伦戴尔不会有事的 安娜\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Nothing's gonna happen to Arendelle, Anna.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.96,0:28:05.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,放心吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}It's gonna be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.29,0:28:06.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Come here.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.06,0:28:15.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果不是在这种情况下\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}You know, under different circumstances,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.51,0:28:19.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里还是挺浪漫的\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}this would be a, uh, pretty romantic place.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:19.10,0:28:19.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不觉得吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Don't you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:19.64,0:28:21.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是在这种情况下\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Different circumstances?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:21.18,0:28:22.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是说 和别人一起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}You mean, like with someone else?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:22.48,0:28:23.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么 不 不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}What? No! No.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.98,0:28:25.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是说\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}I'm saying…
Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.73,0:28:27.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,万一我们没法活着离开这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Just in case we don't make it out of here…
Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.24,0:28:28.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Wait, what?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:28.13,0:28:29.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得我们没法活着离开这里吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}You don't think we're gonna make it out of here?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.46,0:28:30.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}No. No!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.22,0:28:32.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是说 我们会活着离开这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}I mean, no, we will make it out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.41,0:28:34.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,严格来说 我也说不准\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Well, technically the odds are kind of complicated,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.10,0:28:35.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我想说的是\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}but my point is…
Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.49,0:28:36.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,万一我们死掉…\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}In case we die…
Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.82,0:28:39.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你觉得我们会死掉 - 不 不不不\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}- You think we're gonna die? - No! No, no, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.20,0:28:40.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们终究会死 - 艾莎在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}- We will die at some point. - Where's Elsa?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:40.65,0:28:42.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我发誓会在她身边 - 我们近期还不会死\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}- I swore that I wouldn't leave her side. - Not in any recent time will we die.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:42.52,0:28:44.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 艾莎 - 但在久远的未来\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}- Elsa! - But way far in the future,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:44.21,0:28:45.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会死\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}we will die.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.53,0:28:51.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,别损我了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Don't patronize me.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.45,0:29:01.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾莎\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Elsa!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:01.98,0:29:03.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}There you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:03.23,0:29:05.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你没事吧 - 我没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}- You okay? - I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:05.17,0:29:06.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就好\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Okay, good.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:07.37,0:29:08.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,雪宝在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Where's Olaf?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:10.58,0:29:11.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,安娜\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Anna?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:12.12,0:29:13.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾莎\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Elsa?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:13.79,0:29:14.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯文\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Sven?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:15.65,0:29:16.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨曼莎\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Samantha?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:19.67,0:29:22.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我都不认识叫萨曼莎的\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}I don't even know a Samantha.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:33.36,0:29:34.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,习惯就好\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}That's normal.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.81,0:29:48.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}What was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:50.47,0:29:51.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨曼莎\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Samantha?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:56.57,0:30:00.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 等我长大了就会明白 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ This will all make sense when I am older ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:30:00.54,0:30:04.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 终有一天我会明白 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ Someday I will see that this makes sense ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:30:04.69,0:30:08.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 等我长大懂事 我回首往事 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ One day when I'm old and wise I'll think back and realize ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:30:08.69,0:30:11.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 会发现这些都是再正常不过的 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ That these were all completely normal events ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:30:14.42,0:30:18.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 我长大后就会得到答案 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ I'll have all the answers when I'm older ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:30:18.33,0:30:22.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 比如我们为何会在这片黑暗魔法森林中 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ Like why we're in this dark enchanted wood ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:30:22.59,0:30:24.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 我知道过不了几年 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ I know in a couple years ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:30:24.71,0:30:26.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 这些都会变成孩子气的恐惧 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ These will seem like childish fears ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:30:26.77,0:30:29.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 所以我知道所有磨难 都是赐福 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ And so I know this isn't bad, it's good ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:30:29.85,0:30:30.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 打扰了 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ Excuse me ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:30:31.85,0:30:35.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 长大意味着适应 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ Growing up means adapting ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:30:35.92,0:30:39.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 理解世界和自我的关系 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ Puzzling out your world and your place ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:30:39.57,0:30:44.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 等我再成熟一些 就更有安全感 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ When I'm more mature I'll feel totally secure ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:30:44.05,0:30:48.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 可怕的怪物盯着我也不害怕 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ Being watched by something with a creepy, creepy face ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:30:58.84,0:31:03.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 等我长大了就都会明白 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ See, that will all make sense when I am older ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:31:03.25,0:31:06.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 所以根本不用紧张害怕 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ So there's no need to be terrified or tense ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:31:07.89,0:31:11.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 只需要想象自己 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ I'll just dream about a time ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:31:11.00,0:31:14.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 已经长大成人 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ When I'm in my aged prime ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:31:14.81,0:31:17.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 因为等你长大了 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ 'Cause when you're older ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:31:17.43,0:31:22.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 就会明白一切 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ absolutely everything makes sense ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:31:22.75,0:31:24.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,真好\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}This is fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:26.94,0:31:27.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,雪宝\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Olaf!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:32.76,0:31:33.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家好\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Hey, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:33.97,0:31:36.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,认识一下风精灵\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Meet the Wind Spirit.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:37.63,0:31:38.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,借过\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Coming through!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:39.50,0:31:40.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要吐了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}I think I'm gonna be sick.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:40.81,0:31:43.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可以帮你撩着头发 但我找不到胳膊了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}I'd hold your hair back, but I can't find my arms.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:52.82,0:31:53.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,停下\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:05.82,0:32:06.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾莎\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Elsa!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:09.52,0:32:11.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,放开她\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Let her go!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:15.65,0:32:17.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,安娜 小心\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Anna, be careful!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:17.70,0:32:19.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是我姐姐\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}That's my sister!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:23.74,0:32:25.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,安纳尔王子\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Prince Agnarr!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:28.81,0:32:30.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,为了艾伦戴尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}For Arendelle.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:32.97,0:32:34.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,小心\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Look out!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:35.50,0:32:36.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,父亲\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Father!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:45.90,0:32:47.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你没事吧 - 我还好\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}- Are you okay? - I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:49.52,0:32:50.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}What are these?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:52.52,0:32:54.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们看上去像是过去的瞬间\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}They look like moments in time.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:55.93,0:32:57.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是怎么说的来着 雪宝\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}What's that thing you say, Olaf?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:57.95,0:32:59.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说的…\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}The thing…
Dialogue: 0,0:32:59.35,0:33:01.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我说发展技术\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}My theory about advancing technologies.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:01.15,0:33:02.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,既是救星也是劫数的理论吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}as both our savior and our doom?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:02.98,0:33:05.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不是那个 是关于…\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}No, not that one. The one about…
Dialogue: 0,0:33:05.31,0:33:06.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 关于黄瓜的 - 不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}- The one about cucumbers? - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:06.53,0:33:07.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,关于水的\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}The thing about water.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:07.53,0:33:10.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,对了 水有记忆\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Oh! Yeah. Water has memory.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:10.22,0:33:11.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,组成你我的水\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}The water that makes up you and me.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:11.67,0:33:13.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,在我们之前经过了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}has passed through at least four humans…
Dialogue: 0,0:33:13.84,0:33:16.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,至少四个人或动物\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}and/or animals before us.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:18.16,0:33:21.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且记住了一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}And remembers everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:22.44,0:33:23.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,风回来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}The wind's back.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:24.78,0:33:26.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,真棒\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Delicious.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:26.28,0:33:29.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就叫你风灵吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}I think I'll name you Gale.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:30.92,0:33:32.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Get out of there.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:33.09,0:33:35.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你好 - 你可真奇特\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}- Oh. Hi. - Aren't you curious?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:36.94,0:33:38.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,你现在心情好点了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}You in a better mood now?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:49.30,0:33:52.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,父亲 是父亲\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Father. That's Father.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:54.31,0:33:55.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个女孩\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}This girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:55.80,0:33:57.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,她在救他\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}She's saving him.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:57.83,0:33:59.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,她是诺桑德拉人\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}She's Northuldra.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:01.82,0:34:03.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}What is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:03.05,0:34:04.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,雪宝 到我后面去\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Olaf, get behind me.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:07.61,0:34:08.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,你拿那个干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}What are you gonna do with that?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:08.89,0:34:10.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}I have no idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:24.27,0:34:25.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,放下武器\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Lower your weapon.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:26.87,0:34:28.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们先放下\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}And you lower yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:28.56,0:34:30.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾伦戴尔士兵\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Arendellian soldiers?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:30.55,0:34:32.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,威胁我的手下吗 中尉\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Threatening my people, Lieutenant?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:32.53,0:34:35.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,侵略我的舞蹈地盘吗 叶莲娜\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Invading my dance space, Yelena?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:35.33,0:34:37.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么那个士兵看着这么眼熟\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Why does that soldier look so familiar?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:37.93,0:34:38.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,中尉\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Lieutenant!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:38.85,0:34:40.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,去拿那把剑\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Get the sword!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:47.69,0:34:49.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是魔法\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}That was magic.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:49.47,0:34:50.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看见了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Did you see that?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:50.93,0:34:52.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我当然看见了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Of course I saw it.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:52.99,0:34:54.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,你选择了友好冰冷的问好方式\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}You chose a nice, cold greeting.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:54.64,0:34:56.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们一直被困在这里吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}They've been trapped in here this whole time?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:56.87,0:34:58.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 没错 - 我们现在怎么办\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}- Yeah. - What do we do now?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:58.11,0:34:59.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,交给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}I got this.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:59.70,0:35:01.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家好 我是雪宝\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Hi, I'm Olaf.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:02.90,0:35:06.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 我只是觉得穿衣服太拘束了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Oh, sorry. Yeah, I just find clothes restricting.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:06.21,0:35:08.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们一定很好奇我们是谁 为什么在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Bet you're wondering who we are and why we're here.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:08.48,0:35:10.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,答案很简单\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}It's really quite simple.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:10.25,0:35:12.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,是因为一对姐妹\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}It began with two sisters.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:12.54,0:35:14.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个生来具有魔法\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}One born with magical powers.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:14.29,0:35:15.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个生来与常人无异\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}One born powerless.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:15.89,0:35:17.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,她们对雪人的爱 无穷无尽\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Their love of snowmen, infinite.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:17.88,0:35:19.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,安娜 不 太高了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Anna, no! Too high!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:19.27,0:35:20.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘭\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Blast!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:20.89,0:35:22.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈妈 爸爸 救命\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Mama! Papa! Help!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:22.74,0:35:24.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,砰 到处的门都关上了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Slam! Doors shutting everywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:24.72,0:35:26.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,姐妹失散\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Sisters torn apart.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:26.60,0:35:28.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,至少她们还有父母\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Well, at least they have their parents.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:28.91,0:35:30.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,她们的父母去世了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Their parents are dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:30.75,0:35:32.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好 我是安娜\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Oh. Oh, hi. I'm Anna.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:32.39,0:35:33.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要嫁给一个我刚认识的男人\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}I'll marry a man I just met.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:33.70,0:35:34.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾莎要发怒了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Elsa's gonna blow!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:34.93,0:35:37.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,雪 雪 快跑\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Snow! Snow! Aah, run!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:37.75,0:35:39.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,魔法贯穿我的雪花身体\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Magic pulses through my snowflakes.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:40.49,0:35:41.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我活过来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}I live.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:41.38,0:35:43.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,独享冰雪宫殿 独享冰雪宫殿\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Ice palace for one. Ice palace for one.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:43.97,0:35:46.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,出去 安娜\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Get out, Anna. Pew! Pew!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:46.18,0:35:47.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我的小心脏 - 我的天\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}- My heart. - Oh, my goodness.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:47.85,0:35:50.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有真爱之举才能拯救你\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Only an act of true love can save you.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:50.15,0:35:52.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,来一个真爱之吻\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Here's a true love's kiss.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:52.61,0:35:53.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,你配不上\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}You're not worth it.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:53.84,0:35:55.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,你猜怎么着 我是个坏人\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Guess what? I'm the bad guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:55.74,0:35:56.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:56.96,0:36:00.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,安娜被永远地冻死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}And Anna freezes to death forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:00.88,0:36:02.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,安娜\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Oh, Anna.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:02.53,0:36:03.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,她又解冻了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Then she unfreezes!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:03.95,0:36:05.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,随后艾莎唤醒了魔法精灵\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Oh, and then Elsa woke up the magical spirits…
Dialogue: 0,0:36:05.77,0:36:06.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们被赶出了王国\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}and we were forced out of our kingdom.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:06.80,0:36:08.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在唯一的希望就是找出过去的真相\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Now our only hope is to find the truth about the past…
Dialogue: 0,0:36:08.57,0:36:09.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我们不知道该怎么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}but we don't have a clue how to do that…
Dialogue: 0,0:36:09.87,0:36:11.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,除了艾莎能听见那个声音\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}except Elsa's hearing voices,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:11.20,0:36:12.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,这对我们还算有利\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}so we got that going for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:12.88,0:36:14.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有问题吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Any questions?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:17.21,0:36:18.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得他们明白了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}I think they got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:20.43,0:36:22.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真的是艾伦戴尔的女王吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Are you really Queen of Arendelle?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:22.52,0:36:23.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:23.39,0:36:24.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么大自然要以魔法\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Why would nature reward.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:24.56,0:36:26.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,奖赏一个艾伦戴尔人\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}a person of Arendelle with magic?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:26.63,0:36:28.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许是为了弥补你的人民的所作所为\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Perhaps to make up for the actions of your people.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:28.85,0:36:30.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的人民是无辜的\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}My people are innocent.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:30.85,0:36:32.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们绝不会率先动手\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}We would have never attacked first.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:32.64,0:36:34.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,但愿真相水落石出\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}May the truth be found.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:35.34,0:36:36.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,不好意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Hi. I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:37.26,0:36:37.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}What's happening?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:37.95,0:36:40.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,果然没错 马休中尉\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}That's it. Lieutenant Mattias!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:40.35,0:36:42.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,图书馆里左数第二幅画像\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Library, second portrait on the left.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:42.11,0:36:44.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,你曾是我们父亲的侍卫官\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}You were our father's official guard.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:44.89,0:36:46.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,安纳尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Agnarr.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:47.00,0:36:49.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们的父母怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}What did happen to your parents?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:49.56,0:36:51.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,六年前我们父母的船在南海\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Our parents' ship went down in the Southern Sea…
Dialogue: 0,0:36:51.82,0:36:53.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,沉没了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}six years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:57.83,0:37:00.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看到他了 我从你们脸上看到他了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}I see him. I see him in your faces.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:00.97,0:37:01.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:01.91,0:37:03.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,士兵们\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Soldiers.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:03.23,0:37:06.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们可能上了年纪 但依然强壮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}We may be getting on in years, but we're still strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:06.95,0:37:08.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,并且以效忠艾伦戴尔为荣\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}And proud to serve Arendelle.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:09.91,0:37:11.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 拜托了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Wait. Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:12.03,0:37:13.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人将我召唤至此\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Someone has called me here.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:14.38,0:37:16.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我能找到这个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}If I can just find them…
Dialogue: 0,0:37:16.15,0:37:17.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我确信就能找到答案\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}I believe they have the answers.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:17.32,0:37:19.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,帮我们解救这座森林\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}that may help us free this forest.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:20.46,0:37:22.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,相信我 我只是想帮忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Trust me, I just want to help.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:22.75,0:37:25.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们只相信大自然\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}We only trust nature.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:25.18,0:37:26.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,大自然发话时\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}When nature speaks…
Dialogue: 0,0:37:29.47,0:37:30.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们倾听\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}we listen.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:31.40,0:37:33.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,等我长大了 我就能明白了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}This will all make sense when I'm older.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:34.54,0:37:35.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,火精灵\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Fire Spirit!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:37.89,0:37:39.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有人后退\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Get back, everyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:39.46,0:37:40.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,去河边\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Head for the river!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:51.27,0:37:53.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不 不 驯鹿 那是死路\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}No! No! No! The reindeer! That's a dead end!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:53.50,0:37:54.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,快 斯文\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Come on, Sven!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:54.95,0:37:56.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们去追它们\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}We'll get them.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:59.06,0:38:01.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾莎 离开那里\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Elsa! Get out of there!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:01.93,0:38:03.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}No, no, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:08.01,0:38:09.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾莎\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Elsa!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:20.64,0:38:22.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,来 兄弟 我们做得到\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Come on, buddy, we can do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:28.20,0:38:29.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,安娜\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Anna!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:35.57,0:38:36.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,带她走\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Get her out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:36.89,0:38:38.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 艾莎\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}No! Elsa!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:53.21,0:39:55.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们都在看我们 是不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}They're all looking at us, aren't they?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:57.10,0:39:58.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,有什么建议吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Got any advice?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:00.38,0:40:01.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Nothing?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:03.20,0:40:04.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我应该知道这个的意思吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Should I know what that means?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:07.51,0:40:09.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也能听到\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}You hear it, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:09.80,0:40:11.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人在呼唤我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Somebody's calling us.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:12.12,0:40:14.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是谁 我们要怎么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Who is it? What do we do?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:22.87,0:40:25.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 一直往北走\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Okay, keep going north.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:27.87,0:40:28.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾莎\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Elsa!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:29.09,0:40:30.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 谢天谢地 - 安娜\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}- Oh, thank goodness! - Anna.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:30.37,0:40:32.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你还好吗 - 你在做什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}- Are you okay? - What were you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:32.20,0:40:33.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可能会被杀掉的\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}You could've been killed.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:33.27,0:40:35.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不能跟着我往火里跑\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}You can't just follow me into fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:35.46,0:40:37.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不想我跟你跑到火里\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}You don't want me to follow you into fire,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:37.74,0:40:40.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你就不要跑到火里\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}then don't run into fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:40.78,0:40:43.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,你太不小心了 艾莎\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}You're not being careful, Elsa.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:45.73,0:40:48.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 你没事吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}I'm sorry. Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:48.51,0:40:49.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是太好\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}I've been better.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:51.72,0:40:53.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你需要什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}I know what you need.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:57.09,0:40:58.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,你从哪里拿到的那条围巾\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Where did you get that scarf?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:59.58,0:41:01.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是条诺桑德拉围巾\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}That's a Northuldra scarf.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:01.74,0:41:02.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:02.54,0:41:05.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,这条围巾来自我们最古老的家族之一\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}This is from one of our oldest families.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:05.59,0:41:07.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我们母亲的围巾\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}It was our mother's.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:16.26,0:41:17.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾莎\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Elsa.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:17.62,0:41:19.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我懂了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}I see it.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:19.25,0:41:20.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,是母亲\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}It's Mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:21.25,0:41:23.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,母亲那天救了父亲的命\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Mother saved Father's life that day.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:28.32,0:41:30.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的母亲是诺桑德拉人\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Our mother was Northuldra.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:31.83,0:42:33.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们被称为诺桑德拉人\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}We are called Northuldra.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:34.12,0:42:36.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们是太阳的子民\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}We are the people of the sun.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:39.42,0:42:42.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我向你保证 我会解救这座森林\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}I promise you I will free this forest…
Dialogue: 0,0:42:43.05,0:42:44.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,并且拯救艾伦戴尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}and restore Arendelle.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:45.72,0:42:47.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是个相当重大的承诺 艾莎\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}That's a pretty big promise, Elsa.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:49.34,0:42:52.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,解救森林\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Free the Forest?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:52.56,0:42:53.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:53.18,0:42:55.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们中的一些人是在这里出生的\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}It's just, uh, some of us were born in here,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:55.39,0:42:57.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,从来没见过开阔的天空\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}we've never even seen a clear sky.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:57.60,0:42:58.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我懂\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}I get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:58.98,0:43:00.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我叫莱德尔 - 克里斯托弗\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}- The name's Ryder. - Kristoff.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:00.65,0:43:01.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我又听到那声音了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}I heard the voice again.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:02.27,0:43:03.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得去北边\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}We need to go north.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:03.44,0:43:06.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,但北边晚上有土巨人活动\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}But the Earth Giants now roam the north at night.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:06.44,0:43:07.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们可以早上动身\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}You can leave in the morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:08.45,0:43:09.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是哈尼马伦\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}I'm Honeymaren.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:09.61,0:43:11.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈尼马伦 我们会竭尽全力\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Honeymaren, we'll do all we can.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:15.54,0:43:17.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我问你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Hey, let me ask you.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:17.08,0:43:18.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们是怎么应对\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}How do you guys cope…
Dialogue: 0,0:43:18.29,0:43:22.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,因成熟而越发复杂的思想的\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}with the ever-increasing complexity of thought that comes with maturity?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:24.38,0:43:25.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,了不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Brilliant!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:26.17,0:43:28.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,和当今的年轻人谈话真让人耳目一新\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}It's so refreshing to talk to the youth of today.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:28.38,0:43:30.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的未来可期\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Our future's in bright hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:30.05,0:43:31.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不 别啃那个\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Oh, no, no. Don't chew that.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:31.51,0:43:33.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不知道我都踩过什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}You don't know what I've stepped in.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:33.51,0:43:35.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我似乎无法引起她的注意\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}I can't seem to get her attention.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:35.06,0:43:36.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,甚至都没法把话说对\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Or even say the right thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:36.77,0:43:38.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你走运了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Well, you're in luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:38.10,0:43:39.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我对女人一无所知\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}I know nothing about women.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:40.27,0:43:41.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我确实知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}But I do know that we have.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:41.23,0:43:44.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们有最惊人的求婚方式\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}the most amazing way of proposing.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:44.19,0:43:44.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在就开始准备的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}If we start now,
Dialogue: 0,0:43:44.98,0:43:46.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 黎明时我们就能准备好 - 真的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}- we'll be ready by dawn. - Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:46.69,0:43:47.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,最棒的是\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Best part,
Dialogue: 0,0:43:47.61,0:43:49.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,会有很多驯鹿参与\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}it involves a lot of reindeer.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:51.36,0:43:52.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,家乡那边\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Hey, back at home…
Dialogue: 0,0:43:52.91,0:43:54.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,赫利玛还在哈德森酒馆吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Halima still over at Hudson's Hearth?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:54.74,0:43:55.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}She is.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:55.54,0:43:57.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的 她结婚了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Really? She married?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:59.79,0:44:01.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么这并没有让我感觉好些\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Why didn't that make me feel better?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:01.88,0:44:03.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还想念什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}What else do you miss?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:04.34,0:44:05.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我父亲\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}My father.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:05.92,0:44:07.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,他早在这之前就过世了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}He passed long before all this.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:09.17,0:44:11.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是个了不起的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}He was a great man.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:11.84,0:44:13.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我们在艾伦戴尔过上了优裕生活\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Built us a good life in Arendelle.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:13.43,0:44:16.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,但教导我永远不要把优裕当成理所当然的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}But taught me to never take the good for granted.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:16.51,0:44:18.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,他会说「随时做好准备\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}He'd say, "Be prepared.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:18.85,0:44:20.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,你以为找到了自己的路时\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}"Just when you think you've found your way,
Dialogue: 0,0:44:20.39,0:44:22.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,生活就会把你丢到一条新路上「\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}"life will throw you onto a new path."
Dialogue: 0,0:44:23.69,0:44:25.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,那时你该怎么做呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}What do you do when it does?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:25.77,0:44:26.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,别放弃\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Don't give up.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:27.07,0:44:30.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,一步一步慢慢来并且…\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Take it one step at a time and…
Dialogue: 0,0:44:30.82,0:44:32.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,继续做正确的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Just do the next right thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:33.57,0:44:34.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,对\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:34.99,0:44:35.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,你很懂\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}You got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:39.41,0:44:42.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想给你看点东西 可以吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}I wanna show you something. May I?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:45.21,0:44:48.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道风 火 水和土\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}You know air, fire, water, and earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:48.00,0:44:48.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,对\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:48.63,0:44:50.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是看 这里还有第五个精灵\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}But, look, there's a fifth spirit…
Dialogue: 0,0:44:51.13,0:44:54.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,据说是我们和自然魔法之间的桥梁\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}said to be a bridge between us and the magic of nature.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:54.47,0:44:55.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,第五个精灵\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}A fifth spirit?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:55.72,0:44:56.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人说\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Some say.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:56.97,0:44:59.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们听到它在森林沦陷那天发出呼喊\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}they heard it call out the day the Forest fell.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:59.77,0:45:00.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我父亲听到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}My father heard it.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:01.52,0:45:03.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,你认为是它在呼唤我吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Do you think that is who's calling me?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:03.81,0:45:08.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许 只有亚托哈伦知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Maybe. Alas, only Ahtohallan knows.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:08.36,0:45:09.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,亚托哈伦\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Ahtohallan.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:11.69,0:45:15.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 潜入河水深处 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ Dive down deep into her sound ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:45:16.03,0:45:20.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 但别太深 否则会溺亡 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ But not too far or you'll be drowned ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:45:20.79,0:45:22.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么摇篮曲中非要\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Why do lullabies always have to have.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:22.54,0:45:24.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,隐藏一些恐怖的警示呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}some terrible warning in them?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:24.21,0:45:26.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一直想知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}I wonder that all the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:28.63,0:45:29.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,土巨人\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Earth Giants.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:30.71,0:45:32.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们来这里做什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}What are they doing down here?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:35.18,0:45:35.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,躲起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Hide.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:46.27,0:45:47.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}They're coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:55.91,0:45:58.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以说我们不能玩火\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}This is why we don't play with fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:59.58,0:46:02.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没法一直生你的气 你怎么这么可爱\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Oh, I can't stay mad at you. Why are you so cute?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:28.65,0:46:31.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托你告诉我 你不是要跟踪他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Please tell me you were not about to follow them.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:32.28,0:46:34.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,要是我能像安抚风和火一样安抚他们呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}What if I can settle them like I did the wind and fire?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:34.74,0:46:36.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,要是他们在你抓到机会前\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Or what if they can crush you.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:36.24,0:46:38.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,先碾碎你呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}before you even get the chance?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:38.78,0:46:42.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,记住 目标是要找到那声音\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Remember, the goal is to find the voice…
Dialogue: 0,0:46:42.45,0:46:44.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,找到真相 带我们回家\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}find the truth, and get us home.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:45.91,0:46:47.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,伙计们 真险\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Hey, guys. That was close.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:47.54,0:46:48.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:48.79,0:46:51.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,巨人感觉到了我 他们可能还会回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}The giants sensed me. They may come back here.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:51.29,0:46:53.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不想再让其他人陷入危险了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}I don't want to put anyone at risk again.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:53.63,0:46:54.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,并且你说得对 安娜\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}And you're right, Anna.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:54.96,0:46:56.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得去找到那声音\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}We've got to find the voice.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:56.97,0:46:58.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们现在就走\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}We're going now.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:58.18,0:46:59.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 我们走\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Okay. We're going.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:59.59,0:47:00.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我先…\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Let me just…
Dialogue: 0,0:47:03.52,0:47:05.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 克里斯托弗和斯文呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Wait. Where are Kristoff and Sven?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:05.93,0:47:08.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,对了 他们和那个叫莱德尔的\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Oh, yeah. I think they took off with that Ryder guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:08.44,0:47:09.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,以及一群驯鹿走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}and a bunch of reindeer.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:09.73,0:47:11.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}They left?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:11.06,0:47:13.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,一句话都没说就走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Just left without saying anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:13.69,0:47:15.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁知道男人都在想些什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Who knows the ways of men?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:23.08,0:47:25.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我感觉自己特别滑稽 这样正常吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Am I supposed to feel this ridiculous?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:25.62,0:47:26.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然 完全正常\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Oh, yeah. Definitely.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:28.08,0:47:28.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,大伙都准备好了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Everyone ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:29.21,0:47:30.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,准备好啦\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Ready!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:30.16,0:47:31.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还想再彩排一次\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}I could use a rehearsal.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:31.33,0:47:32.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我对爱情超级痴迷\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}I love love.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:32.63,0:47:34.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 你也替它们说话吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Wait. You talk for them, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:34.71,0:47:35.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:35.71,0:47:37.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像是你能听到它们的想法\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}It's like you can actually hear what they're thinking.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:37.51,0:47:39.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 然后就脱口而出\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Yeah. And then you just say it.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:39.97,0:47:41.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,就那么脱口而出\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}And then you just say it.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:44.14,0:47:45.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 她来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Okay. Here she comes.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:47.64,0:47:49.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾伦戴尔王国的安娜公主\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Princess Anna of Arendelle…
Dialogue: 0,0:47:49.89,0:47:53.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我那充满活力 无所畏惧 又热辣甜美的爱人\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}my feisty, fearless, ginger-sweet love.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:54.32,0:47:56.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,你愿意嫁给我吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Will you marry me?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:58.95,0:47:59.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,不愿意\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:00.53,0:48:02.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,公主已经和女王一起离开了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}The princess left with the queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:02.49,0:48:04.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么 等等 你说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}What? Wait, what? What?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:04.66,0:48:07.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,要是我就不会去追 她们已经离开很久了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}I wouldn't try to follow. They're long gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:07.75,0:48:08.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,离开很久了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Long gone?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:09.21,0:48:11.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}So, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:13.46,0:48:15.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们即将朝西前往青藓草原\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}We're heading west to the Lichen Meadows.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:15.50,0:48:17.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你想的话可以随我们同去\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}You can come with us if you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:23.88,0:48:25.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很遗憾…\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}I'm really sorry that…
Dialogue: 0,0:48:25.26,0:48:27.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 没事 不要紧 - 好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}- No, it's fine. - Yeah. Yep.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:28.22,0:48:31.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 我该去整理行装了 你要和我一起吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Okay, I better go pack. You coming with?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:31.27,0:48:32.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还是…好 我一会去找你\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}I'll just… Yeah, I'll meet you there.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:32.98,0:48:35.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好的 你知道怎么走 对吧 - 是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}- Okay, uh, you know where you're going, right? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:35.65,0:48:36.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 没错 - 好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}- Yeah. - Yep.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:36.44,0:48:37.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我熟悉森林\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}I know the woods.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:50.62,0:48:53.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 驯鹿比人类更好相处 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ Reindeers are better than people ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:48:54.54,0:48:58.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 斯文 为何爱情如此艰难 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ Sven, why is love so hard? ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:49:00.30,0:49:02.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 无论你感受到什么 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ You feel what you feel ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:49:02.26,0:49:04.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 那都是真实的 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ And those feelings are real ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:49:05.51,0:49:07.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 来吧 克里斯托弗 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ Come on, Kristoff ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:49:07.26,0:49:11.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 卸下你的防备 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ Let down your guard ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:49:25.11,0:49:26.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 你又一次离去 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ Again, you're gone ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:49:28.66,0:49:31.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 走上和我不同的路途 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ Off on a diff'rent path than mine ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:49:31.95,0:49:33.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 我被留在原地 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ I'm left behind ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:49:33.87,0:49:38.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 不知是否应该追随 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ Wondering if I should follow ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:49:38.80,0:49:40.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 你不得不离去 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ You had to go ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:49:42.88,0:49:45.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 这当然没什么问题 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ And, of course, it's always fine ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:49:46.55,0:49:52.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 我也许明日便可追上你的步伐 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ I prob'ly could catch up with you tomorrow ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:49:53.18,0:49:59.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 可为何 我感觉与你日渐疏离 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ But is this what it feels like to be growing apart? ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:49:59.86,0:50:02.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 我从何时开始 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ When did I become the one ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:50:02.32,0:50:06.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 一刻不停在追赶你的心 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ Who's always chasing your heart? ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:50:06.45,0:50:09.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 如今我环顾四周 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ Now I turn around and find ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:50:09.33,0:50:12.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 却发现自己迷失于森林 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ I am lost in the woods ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:50:12.45,0:50:15.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 南北不分 左右不清 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ North is South, right is left ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:50:15.58,0:50:18.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 没有你便失去方向 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ When you're gone ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:50:18.92,0:50:21.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 本该由我护佑你回家 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ I'm the one who sees you home ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:50:21.75,0:50:25.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 而如今我却迷失于森林 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ But now I'm lost in the woods ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:50:25.80,0:50:31.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 也不知道你去向何方 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ And I don't know what path you are on ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:50:31.72,0:50:33.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 我迷失于森林 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ I'm lost in the woods ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:50:38.19,0:50:39.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 直至此刻 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ Up till now ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:50:40.40,0:50:44.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 我一直想着如何向你求婚 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ The next step was a question of how ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:50:44.74,0:50:50.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 从不需怀疑你我是否真正属于彼此 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ I never thought it was a question of whether ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:50:50.70,0:50:52.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 如果我不是你的真命天子 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ Who am I ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:50:54.62,0:50:57.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 那我又是谁 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ If I'm not your guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:57.54,0:51:02.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 如果我们不能永远在一起 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ Where am I if we're not together? ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:51:03.09,0:51:06.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 我又该去向何方 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ Forever ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:51:06.30,0:51:09.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 现在我明白 你是我的北极星 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ Now I know you're my true North ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:51:09.05,0:51:12.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 因为我已迷失在这森林 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ 'Cause I am lost in the woods ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:51:12.64,0:51:15.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 你不在我身旁 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ Up is down, day is night ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:51:15.35,0:51:18.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 日夜颠倒 方寸大乱 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ When you're not there ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:51:19.02,0:51:22.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 你是我唯一的方向 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ Oh, you're my only landmark ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:51:22.15,0:51:25.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 我此刻迷失于森林 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ So I'm lost in the woods.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:26.15,0:51:30.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 不知你是否仍对我在意 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ Wondering if you still care ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:51:31.45,0:51:33.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 但我会等候 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ But I'll wait ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:51:35.04,0:51:37.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 等候一个启示 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ For a sign ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:51:37.92,0:51:41.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 让我知道自己是你的方向 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ That I'm your path ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:51:41.04,0:51:44.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 因为你就是我的方向 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ 'Cause you are mine ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:51:44.80,0:51:46.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 在那之前 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ Until then ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:51:46.67,0:51:48.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 我迷失于森林 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ I'm lost in the woods ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:51:48.80,0:51:50.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 迷失于森林 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ Lost in the woods ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:51:50.84,0:51:51.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 于森林 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ In the woods ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:51:51.91,0:51:53.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 迷失于森林 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ Lost in the woods ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:51:53.22,0:51:55.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 我迷失于森林 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ I'm lost in the woods ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:51:55.18,0:51:57.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 迷失于森林 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ Lost in the woods ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:51:57.57,0:51:59.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 迷失于 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ I'm lost ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:51:59.56,0:52:05.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 我迷失于森林 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ I'm lost in the woods ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:52:28.59,0:52:32.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,雪宝 也许你们中一个人喊就够了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Hey, Olaf, um, maybe just one of you should do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:32.18,0:52:34.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我同意 她声音有点太尖了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}I agree. She's a little pitchy.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:35.56,0:52:37.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,看啊 风灵回来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Hey, Gale's back.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:43.06,0:52:43.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:52.66,0:52:54.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么会这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}How can it be?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:54.87,0:52:55.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:56.99,0:52:58.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,父亲和母亲的船\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Mother and Father's ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:59.04,0:53:01.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,可这里并不是南海\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}But this isn't the Southern Sea.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:01.75,0:53:03.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,确实 这里不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}No, it isn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:17.31,0:53:18.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们的船为什么会在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Why is their ship here?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:19.89,0:53:21.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么会在这里呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}How is it here?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:22.77,0:53:25.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,肯定是从暗黑海域被冲过来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}It must have been washed in from the Dark Sea.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:25.65,0:53:27.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们在暗黑海域做什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}What were they doing in the Dark Sea?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:29.53,0:53:30.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:31.49,0:53:34.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,这艘船是如何穿过迷雾的\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}How did the ship get through the mist?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:34.20,0:53:36.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以为除了我们没人能做到\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}I thought nobody could but us.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:36.78,0:53:39.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,除非这艘船上没有人\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Unless nobody was on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:40.87,0:53:42.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里肯定会有什么线索的\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}There's gotta be something here.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:43.08,0:53:44.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 四处找找\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Wait. Wait. Look around.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:45.67,0:53:48.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,每一艘艾伦戴尔的船都有一个装置\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Every Arendellian ship has a compartment.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:48.42,0:53:49.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,是防水的\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Waterproof.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:50.05,0:53:52.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,那非常聪明\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}That's very clever.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:52.17,0:53:53.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过 那让我不禁要问\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Although, it does make me wonder.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:53.34,0:53:55.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么不把整艘船都造成防水的呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}why they don't just make the whole ship waterproof.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:02.56,0:54:03.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,在这\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:09.36,0:54:11.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是什么语言\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}What language is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:11.48,0:54:12.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:12.69,0:54:15.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过 这是母亲的笔迹\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}But look, this is Mother's handwriting.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:15.49,0:54:17.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,「在冰河世纪之末\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}"The end of the ice age.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:17.16,0:54:19.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,发现了这条河流 却又遗失了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}"The river found, but lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:19.37,0:54:22.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是魔法的源头 是否也是艾莎的源头「\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}"Magic's source. Elsa's source?"
Dialogue: 0,0:54:26.04,0:54:27.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是一幅地图\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}It's a map.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:28.92,0:54:30.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们向北行进\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}They traveled north.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:30.59,0:54:33.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,打算穿越暗黑海域\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}and planned to cross the Dark Sea to…
Dialogue: 0,0:54:34.47,0:54:35.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,亚托哈伦\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Ahtohallan.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:36.88,0:54:37.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的存在\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}It's real?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:38.22,0:54:39.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,亚托什么玩意儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Octa-who-what?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:39.60,0:54:40.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,亚托哈伦\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Ahtohallan.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:41.01,0:54:42.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是一条魔法河流\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}It's a magical river.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:42.81,0:54:45.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,据说那条河里有所有关于过去的答案\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}said to hold all the answers about the past.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:45.69,0:54:48.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,再次证明了我说的水有记忆的理论\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Reinforcing my "water has memory" theory. Mm.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:49.31,0:54:50.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,水有记忆\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Water has memory.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:57.45,0:54:58.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾莎\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Elsa?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:59.74,0:55:01.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想知道他们发生了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}I wanna know what happened to them.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:09.90,0:55:12.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,亚托哈伦一定是魔法的来源\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Ahtohallan has to be the source of her magic.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:12.13,0:55:13.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,为了艾莎 我们要继续前行\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}We keep going for Elsa.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:13.92,0:55:14.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,海浪太高了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}The waves are too high!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:14.96,0:55:16.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 艾杜娜 - 安纳尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}- Iduna! - Agnarr!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:21.05,0:55:21.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾莎\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Elsa!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:31.38,0:55:32.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这是怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:32.61,0:55:33.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,都怪我\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}This is my fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:34.40,0:55:36.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们在寻找关于我的答案\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}They were looking for answers about me.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:36.94,0:55:40.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不必为他们的选择负责 艾莎\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}You are not responsible for their choices, Elsa.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:40.11,0:55:41.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 但他们因我而死\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}No. Just their deaths.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:42.50,0:55:44.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,停下 不是这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Stop. No.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:44.54,0:55:45.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,叶莲娜问过\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Yelena asked,
Dialogue: 0,0:55:45.75,0:55:49.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么精灵会奖赏艾伦戴尔一个魔法女王\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}why would the spirits reward Arendelle with a magical queen?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:49.75,0:55:52.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我们的母亲救了父亲\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Because our mother saved our father.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:52.96,0:55:55.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,她救了自己的敌人\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}She saved her enemy.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:55.46,0:55:59.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就是她的善举的回报\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Her good deed was rewarded with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:59.59,0:56:01.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是礼物\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}You are a gift.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:01.18,0:56:02.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么礼物\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}For what?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:02.55,0:56:04.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果有人能解开过去\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}If anyone can resolve the past…
Dialogue: 0,0:56:04.76,0:56:07.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果有人能拯救艾伦戴尔 解救森林\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}if anyone can save Arendelle and free this forest,
Dialogue: 0,0:56:07.85,0:56:08.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就是你\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}it's you.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:09.85,0:56:13.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我信任你 艾莎 胜于任何人任何事\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}I believe in you, Elsa. More than anyone or anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:20.78,0:56:23.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈尼马伦说有第五个精灵\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Honeymaren said there was a fifth spirit.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:23.37,0:56:26.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,自然魔法和我们之间的桥梁\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}A bridge between the magic of nature and us.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:26.74,0:56:28.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,第五个精灵\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}A fifth spirit?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:28.16,0:56:30.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是它在亚托哈伦呼唤我\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}That's who's been calling me from Ahtohallan.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:31.29,0:56:33.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,关于过去的答案都在那里\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}The answers about the past are all there.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:35.09,0:56:36.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我们就去亚托哈伦\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}So we go to Ahtohallan.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:37.63,0:56:38.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是「我们」\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Not "we."
Dialogue: 0,0:56:39.67,0:56:41.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我自己 - 什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}- Me. - what?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:41.22,0:56:43.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们两个一起去暗黑海域太危险\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}The Dark Sea is too dangerous for us both.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:43.68,0:56:46.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不 我们要一起解决\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}No. No! We do this together.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:46.47,0:56:47.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,记得那首歌吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Remember the song?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:47.72,0:56:50.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,「别潜太深 否则会溺亡」\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}"Go too far and you'll be drowned."
Dialogue: 0,0:56:50.27,0:56:52.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁来阻止你太过深入\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Who will stop you from going too far?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:52.52,0:56:53.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说你信任我\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}You said you believed in me,
Dialogue: 0,0:56:53.48,0:56:55.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,说我天生要做这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}that this is what I was born to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:55.48,0:56:58.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不想阻止你那么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}And I don't wanna stop you from that.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:58.28,0:57:02.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我…不想阻止你做你需要做的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}I… I don't wanna stop you from being whatever you need to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:02.45,0:57:05.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是不想你\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}I just don't want you dying…
Dialogue: 0,0:57:05.32,0:57:08.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,试图做大家需要的人而死\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}trying to be everything for everyone else, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:09.25,0:57:10.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要一个人去\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Don't do this alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:10.75,0:57:12.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,请让我帮你\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Let me help you, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:13.50,0:57:15.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不能失去你 艾莎\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}I can't lose you, Elsa.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:18.42,0:57:20.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也不能失去你 安娜\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}I can't lose you either, Anna.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:22.13,0:57:22.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:25.85,0:57:26.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Wait, what?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:27.05,0:57:27.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在做什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:28.72,0:57:29.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾莎\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Elsa!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:32.94,0:57:34.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}No! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:34.44,0:57:35.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,雪宝 帮我停下\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Olaf, help me stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:36.15,0:57:37.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,帮我一把\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Give me a hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:40.53,0:57:41.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,坐稳\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Hang on!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:42.28,0:57:43.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 不 不 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Wait. Wait! No! No! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:43.95,0:57:45.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:46.03,0:57:48.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,安娜 这听起来可能很疯狂\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Anna, this might sound crazy…
Dialogue: 0,0:57:48.20,0:57:50.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我感觉到了怒气高涨\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}but I'm sensing some rising anger.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:51.37,0:57:53.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我确实生气 雪宝\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Well, I am angry, Olaf!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:53.21,0:57:55.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,她答应过我们会一起解决\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}She promised me we'd do this together!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:55.88,0:57:56.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:56.83,0:58:00.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过我的意思是 我感觉到我怒气高涨\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}But what I mean is, I'm sensing rising anger in me.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:01.38,0:58:03.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 你在生气吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Wait, you're angry?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:03.26,0:58:05.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我…我想是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}I… I think so.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:05.72,0:58:07.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾莎也把我推开了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Elsa pushed me away, too,
Dialogue: 0,0:58:07.43,0:58:09.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,甚至没说再见\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}and didn't even say goodbye.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:10.35,0:58:13.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,你完全有权利对她非常非常生气\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}And you have every right to be very, very mad at her.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:13.89,0:58:16.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说有些事永远不会变\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}And you said some things never change.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:16.27,0:58:17.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,但那之后\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}But since then,
Dialogue: 0,0:58:17.61,0:58:20.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有事都在变\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}everything's done nothing but change.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:21.15,0:58:21.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:22.99,0:58:26.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过瞧 我还在这里 握着你的手\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}But look, I'm still here holding your hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:27.28,0:58:29.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 说得有道理 安娜\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Yeah, that's a good point, Anna.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:29.62,0:58:32.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我感觉好点了 你真是个好倾听者\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}I feel better. You're such a good listener.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:33.12,0:58:35.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,别让我噤声 那很无礼\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Don't shush me. That's rude.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:35.50,0:58:36.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}No! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:47.09,0:58:48.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,巨人们\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}The Giants.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:48.76,0:58:50.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们真庞大\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}They're huge.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:06.95,0:59:07.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,抓稳 雪宝\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Hang on, Olaf.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:14.29,0:59:15.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,尽量别尖叫\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Try not to scream.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:29.05,0:59:29.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,找到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Found it.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:31.68,0:59:32.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:33.47,0:59:34.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Where are we?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:35.43,0:59:37.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,在一个没有出路的深坑\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}In a pit with no way out.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:37.81,0:59:41.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过有个可怕的漆黑入口\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}But with a spooky, pitch-black way in.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:47.58,0:59:49.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,快来 会很好玩的\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Come on, it'll be fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:49.49,0:59:51.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,假设我们不会永远被困这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Assuming we don't get stuck here forever,
Dialogue: 0,0:59:51.28,0:59:52.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,没人找到我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}no one ever finds us…
Dialogue: 0,0:59:52.28,0:59:53.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你饿死 我放弃\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}and you starve and I give up.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:54.54,0:59:59.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过好的一面 艾莎的情况肯定比我们好得多\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}But, bright side, Elsa's gotta be doing a whole lot better than we are.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:37.16,1:00:37.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,好\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:28.46,1:01:29.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}No!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:12.59,1:02:13.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}No!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:40.58,1:02:41.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Of course.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:43.58,1:02:45.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,冰川是冰的河流\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Glaciers are rivers of ice.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:48.00,1:02:49.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,亚托哈伦结冰了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Ahtohallan is frozen.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:55.34,1:02:56.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我听到了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}I hear you.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:57.22,1:02:58.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在我来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}And I'm coming.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:05.16,1:03:08.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 我浑身都在颤抖 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ Every inch of me is trembling ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:03:08.52,1:03:13.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 但不是因为冷 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ But not from the cold ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:03:13.62,1:03:15.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 似曾相识的感觉 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ Something is familiar ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:03:16.22,1:03:20.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 就像近在咫尺又触不可及的梦 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ Like a dream I can reach but not quite hold ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:03:21.23,1:03:23.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 我能感觉你在那里 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ I can sense you there ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:03:24.37,1:03:29.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 像我认识了一生的朋友 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ Like a friend I've always known ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:03:29.13,1:03:32.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 我就要到达 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ I'm arriving ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:03:32.48,1:03:37.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 感觉像回到了家 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ And it feels like I am home ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:03:37.13,1:03:41.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 我一直高竖壁垒 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ I have always been a fortress ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:03:41.16,1:03:45.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 深藏冰冷的秘密 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ Cold secrets deep inside ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:03:45.65,1:03:49.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 你也有秘密 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ You have secrets, too ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:03:49.46,1:03:53.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 但你不必隐匿 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ But you don't have to hide ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:03:53.59,1:03:55.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 请你现身 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ Show yourself ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:03:56.19,1:03:59.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 我渴望见到你 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ I'm dying to meet you ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:03:59.60,1:04:01.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 请你现身 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ Show yourself ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:04:02.62,1:04:05.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 轮到你了 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ It's your turn ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:04:05.70,1:04:13.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 你是那个我找寻一生的人吗 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ Are you the one I've been looking for all of my life? ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:04:13.65,1:04:16.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 请你现身 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ Show yourself ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:04:16.66,1:04:20.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 我准备好知晓 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ I'm ready to learn ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:04:27.11,1:04:29.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 我从未如此确定 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ I've never felt so certain ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:04:29.70,1:04:34.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 我一直以来饱受折磨∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ All my life I've been torn ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:04:34.86,1:04:37.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 但我来这是有原因的 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ But I'm here for a reason ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:04:37.70,1:04:42.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 这会不会是我出生的原因 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ Could it be the reason I was born? ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:04:42.27,1:04:46.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 我一直与众不同 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ I have always been so different ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:04:46.07,1:04:50.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 寻常规则并不适用 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ Normal rules did not apply ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:04:50.24,1:04:54.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 今天你会告诉我答案吗 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ Is this the day? Are you the way ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:04:54.05,1:04:58.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 我终于找到原因了吗 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ I finally find out why? ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:04:58.03,1:04:59.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 请你现身 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ Show yourself! ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:05:00.51,1:05:03.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 我不再颤抖 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ I'm no longer trembling ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:05:03.92,1:05:06.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 我在这里 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ Here I am ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:05:06.11,1:05:09.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 历经千辛万苦 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ I've come so far ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:05:09.71,1:05:16.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 你是我等待了一生的答案 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ You are the answer I've waited for all of my life ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:05:16.40,1:05:19.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 请你现身 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ Oh, show yourself! ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:05:19.75,1:05:24.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 让我看看你是谁 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ Let me see who you are ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:05:24.98,1:05:28.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 快来我身边 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ Come to me now ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:05:28.88,1:05:32.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 打开你的门 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ Open your door ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:05:32.71,1:05:36.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 别让我等待 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ Don't make me wait ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:05:36.54,1:05:39.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 再多一刻 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ One moment more ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:05:39.82,1:05:44.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 快来我身边 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ Oh, come to me now ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:05:44.20,1:05:48.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 打开你的门 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ Open your door ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:05:48.08,1:05:51.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 别让我等待 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ Don't make me wait ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:05:51.88,1:06:00.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 再多一刻 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ One moment more ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:06:02.62,1:06:09.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 北风与海洋交汇之处 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ Where the Northwind meets the sea ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:06:10.19,1:06:13.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 有条河流 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ There's a river ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:06:13.80,1:06:15.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 盈满记忆 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ Full of memory ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:06:15.17,1:06:16.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,母亲\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Mother.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:17.52,1:06:22.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 来吧 宝贝 回到故乡 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ Come, my darling, homeward bound ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:06:22.91,1:06:27.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 找到自我 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ I am found! ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:06:27.91,1:06:30.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 展现自我 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ Show yourself ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:06:30.28,1:06:33.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 释放你的能量 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ Step into your power ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:06:33.54,1:06:36.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 让你自己 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ Grow yourself ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:06:36.07,1:06:39.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 成长为崭新的人 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ Into something new ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:06:39.45,1:06:42.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 你就是自己期待已久的人 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ You are the one you've been waiting for ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:06:42.49,1:06:46.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,- ∮ 期待一生 ∮ - ∮ 期待一生 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}- ∮ All of my life ∮ - ∮ All of your life ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:06:46.29,1:06:51.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 展现自我 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ Oh, show yourself! ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:07:13.97,1:07:17.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好 我是雪宝 我喜欢温暖的拥抱\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Hi, I'm Olaf. And I like warm hugs.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:17.04,1:07:19.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我爱你 雪宝\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}I love you, Olaf!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:20.28,1:07:22.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧 你可以的\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Come on, you can do it.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:22.34,1:07:24.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 站在这里 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ Here I stand ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:07:24.92,1:07:26.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 不再藏匿 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ In the light of day ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:07:26.50,1:07:29.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,鸡一样灵巧 猴一样可爱\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Like a chicken with the face of a monkey!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:29.06,1:07:30.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我走路不小心\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}I just wasn't looking where I was going.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:30.64,1:07:32.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是我真的没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}But I'm great actually.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:32.51,1:07:35.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是南部群岛的汉斯王子\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Prince Hans of the Southern Isles.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:36.16,1:07:36.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我爱你\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}I love you.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:36.92,1:07:38.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我得告诉你我的过去\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}I need to tell you about my past.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:38.71,1:07:39.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来自哪里\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}And where I'm from.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:39.83,1:07:41.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}I'm listening.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:42.54,1:07:43.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾杜娜\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Iduna!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:43.39,1:07:44.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在读什么 陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}What are you reading, Your Majesty?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:44.87,1:07:46.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,丹麦的新作家写的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Oh, some new Danish author.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:53.76,1:07:56.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,鲁纳德国王 抱歉 我不明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}King Runeard, I'm sorry. I don't understand.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:56.39,1:07:57.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,祖父\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Grandfather?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:57.64,1:07:59.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们带上艾伦戴尔的全部护卫\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}We bring Arendelle's full guard.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:59.69,1:08:02.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我们没理由不信任他们啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}But they have given us no reason not to trust them.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:03.72,1:08:05.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,诺桑德拉信奉魔法\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}The Northuldra follow magic.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:05.52,1:08:07.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我们永远都不能信任他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Which means we can never trust them.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:07.30,1:08:08.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,祖父\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Grandfather?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:08.32,1:08:11.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,魔法会让人感觉太过强大 理所应当\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Magic makes people feel too powerful. Too entitled.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:11.80,1:08:16.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,会让他们觉得可以违抗国王的意志\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}It makes them think they can defy the will of a king.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:16.11,1:08:17.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,魔法并不会这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}That is not what magic does.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:17.95,1:08:19.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,这只是你的恐惧而已\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}That's just your fear.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:19.78,1:08:22.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,恐惧才是不能信任的\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Fear is what can't be trusted.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:29.05,1:08:31.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,大坝会让他们的领土变脆弱\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}You see, the dam will weaken their lands,
Dialogue: 0,1:08:31.58,1:08:33.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以他们必须来求助于我\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}so they will have to turn to me.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:35.07,1:08:39.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 潜入河水深处 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ Dive down deep into her sound ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:08:39.50,1:08:44.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 但别太深 否则会溺亡 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ But not too far, or you'll be drowned ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:08:44.26,1:08:46.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们会来庆祝\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}They will come in celebration.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:46.44,1:08:50.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们就能摸清他们的实力\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}And then, we will know their size and strength.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:51.80,1:08:55.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,如同你们欢迎我们一样 我们也欢迎你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}As you have welcomed us, we welcome you…
Dialogue: 0,1:08:55.21,1:08:58.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的邻居 我们的朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}our neighbors, our friends.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:15.59,1:09:18.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,鲁纳德国王 大坝使我们的水流变急\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}King Runeard, the dam isn't strengthening our waters.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:18.54,1:09:20.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,正在危害森林\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}It's hurting the Forest.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:20.11,1:09:21.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,切断了北方…\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}It's cutting off the North…
Dialogue: 0,1:09:21.45,1:09:23.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,先…先别谈这些\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Let… Let's not discuss this here.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:23.29,1:09:26.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,来峡湾再说 喝喝茶\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Let's meet on the fjord. Have tea.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:26.25,1:09:27.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,想想办法\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Find a solution.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:39.54,1:09:40.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}No!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:46.78,1:09:47.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,安娜\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Anna!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:57.81,1:10:01.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要选择哪个幸运的地道\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Which lucky tunnel do we choose?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:02.12,1:10:04.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,大坝会让他们的领土变脆弱\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}You see, the dam will weaken their lands,
Dialogue: 0,1:10:04.57,1:10:06.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以他们必须来求助于我\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}so they will have to turn to me.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:06.18,1:10:07.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,鲁纳德国王 大坝\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}King Runeard, the dam,
Dialogue: 0,1:10:07.48,1:10:09.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,正在危害森林\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}it's hurting the Forest.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:14.46,1:10:15.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾莎找到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Elsa's found it.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:16.08,1:10:17.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}What is it?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:17.61,1:10:19.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,关于过去的真相\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}The truth about the past.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:20.49,1:10:22.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是我的祖父\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}That's my grandfather…
Dialogue: 0,1:10:22.80,1:10:25.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,正在袭击诺桑德拉的首领\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}attacking the Northuldra leader…
Dialogue: 0,1:10:26.14,1:10:28.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,而对方手无寸铁\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}who wields no weapon.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:31.41,1:10:34.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,大坝不是和平的礼物\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}The dam wasn't a gift of peace.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:34.88,1:10:36.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,而是一个骗局\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}It was a trick.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:36.68,1:10:40.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,但那样就违背了艾伦戴尔所代表的一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}But that goes against everything Arendelle stands for.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:40.46,1:10:42.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 确实如此\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}It does, doesn't it?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:44.81,1:10:47.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道该怎么解救森林了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}I know how to free the Forest.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:47.38,1:10:51.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道我们该怎么纠正一切了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}I know what we have to do to set things right.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:51.67,1:10:54.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为什么说得那么悲伤\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Why do you say that so sadly?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:54.66,1:10:56.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得破坏大坝\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}We have to break the dam.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:56.59,1:10:58.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,但艾伦戴尔会被水淹没\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}But Arendelle will be flooded.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:59.03,1:11:01.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以精灵逼迫大家离开了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}That's why everyone was forced out.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:01.82,1:11:05.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,为了保护他们不受伤害\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}To protect them from what has to be done.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:10.22,1:11:11.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:12.06,1:11:14.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我现在很需要听一些开心的事 雪宝\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}I could really use a bright side, Olaf.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:14.73,1:11:16.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,开心的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Bright side?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:17.21,1:11:19.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,海龟可以用屁股呼吸\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Turtles can breathe through their butts.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:20.26,1:11:23.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有 我看到出去的路了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}And I see a way out.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:24.78,1:11:26.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就知道你靠得住\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}I knew I could count on you.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:31.04,1:11:34.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,走吧 雪宝 艾莎可能也在回来的路上\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Come on, Olaf, Elsa's probably on her way back right now.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:34.60,1:11:36.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们可以和她会合 然后…\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}We can meet her and…
Dialogue: 0,1:11:38.05,1:11:39.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,雪宝\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Olaf?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:39.81,1:11:41.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}What's this?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:41.53,1:11:42.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:42.92,1:11:44.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在下雪\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}I'm flurrying?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:45.23,1:11:46.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 不对 不是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Wait. No. That's…
Dialogue: 0,1:11:46.21,1:11:47.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是下雪\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}That's not it.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:49.32,1:11:52.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要变成雪消失了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}I'm flurrying away.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:53.44,1:11:56.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我身上的魔法正在消失\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}The magic in me is fading.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:56.87,1:11:57.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}What?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:59.65,1:12:02.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾莎可能出事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}I don't think Elsa's okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:02.97,1:12:04.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得…\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}I think…
Dialogue: 0,1:12:05.22,1:12:07.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,她可能太深入了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}she may have gone too far.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:08.65,1:12:11.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}No. No.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:11.02,1:12:12.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,安娜\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Anna?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:12.69,1:12:14.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:14.77,1:12:17.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,接下来的事就要靠你自己了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}You're gonna have to do this next part on your own.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:18.27,1:12:19.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好吗 - 等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}- Okay? - Wait.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:19.92,1:12:20.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Come here.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:21.34,1:12:22.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,有我在\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}I've got you.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:24.12,1:12:25.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,真好\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}That's good.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:27.32,1:12:28.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,安娜\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Hey, Anna?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:29.31,1:12:32.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想到了一个永恒不变的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}I just thought of one thing that's permanent.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:32.27,1:12:33.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}What's that?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:34.27,1:12:35.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,爱\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Love.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:37.03,1:12:38.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,要温暖的拥抱吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Warm hugs?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:42.85,1:12:44.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我喜欢温暖的拥抱\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}I like warm hugs.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:53.88,1:12:55.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我爱你\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}I love you.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:01.68,1:14:04.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,雪宝 艾莎\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Olaf? Elsa?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:05.96,1:14:07.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我现在该怎么办\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}What do I do now?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:12.08,1:14:14.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 我也曾见过黑暗 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ I've seen dark before ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:14:14.66,1:14:16.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 但不是这样 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ But not like this ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:14:17.60,1:14:22.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 这是寒冷 空虚 麻木 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ This is cold, this is empty, this is numb ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:14:23.62,1:14:26.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 我熟知的生活已经结束 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ The life I knew is over ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:14:26.25,1:14:27.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 灯光熄灭 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ The lights are out ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:14:28.48,1:14:30.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 你好 黑暗 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ Hello, darkness ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:14:30.49,1:14:32.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 我准备好屈服了 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ I'm ready to succumb ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:14:35.19,1:14:37.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 我跟随着你 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ I follow you around ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:14:37.92,1:14:39.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 一直都是 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ I always have ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:14:40.21,1:14:44.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 但你去了一个我找不到的地方 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ But you've gone to a place I cannot find ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:14:45.89,1:14:49.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 悲伤有引力 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ This grief has a gravity ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:14:49.89,1:14:52.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 拽着我下沉 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ It pulls me down ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:14:56.39,1:14:58.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 但一个微小的声音 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ But a tiny voice ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:14:59.25,1:15:02.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 在我心中低语 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ Whispers in my mind ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:15:04.44,1:15:06.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 你迷失了 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ You are lost ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:15:06.96,1:15:08.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 没有希望 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ Hope is gone ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:15:09.62,1:15:13.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 但你必须要前进 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ But you must go on ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:15:15.29,1:15:19.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 继续做正确的事 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ And do the next right thing ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:15:27.15,1:15:31.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 黑夜过后会天亮吗 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ Can there be a day beyond this night? ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:15:31.80,1:15:35.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 我再也不懂什么是真实 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ I don't know anymore what is true ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:15:36.68,1:15:41.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 我找不到方向 孤身一人 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ I can't find my direction I'm all alone ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:15:41.31,1:15:47.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 唯一指引我的星辰曾是你 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ The only star that guided me was you ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:15:47.81,1:15:52.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 没有你的鼓励 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ How to rise from the floor ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:15:52.17,1:15:56.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 我还如何振作 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ When it's not you I'm rising for? ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:15:57.09,1:16:01.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 继续做正确的事 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ Just do the next right thing ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:16:01.68,1:16:03.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 迈出一步 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ Take a step ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:16:03.86,1:16:05.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 再迈一步 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ Step again ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:16:06.12,1:16:10.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 尽我所能 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ It is all that I can ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:16:10.61,1:16:16.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 继续做正确的事 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ To do the next right thing ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:16:18.50,1:16:21.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 我不会好高骛远 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ I won't look too far ahead ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:16:22.84,1:16:26.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 我不会不自量力 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ It's too much for me to take ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:16:26.72,1:16:29.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 我选择着眼脚下 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ But break it down to this next breath ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:16:30.15,1:16:31.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 下一步 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ This next step ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:16:32.33,1:16:38.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 下一个选择 由我来决定 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ This next choice is one that I can make! ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:16:39.06,1:16:43.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 我要走出黑夜 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ So I'll walk through this night ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:16:43.48,1:16:48.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 跌跌撞撞 找寻光明 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ Stumbling blindly toward the light ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:16:48.48,1:16:52.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 继续做正确的事 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ And do the next right thing ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:16:53.66,1:16:56.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 黎明到来 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ And with the dawn ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:16:56.19,1:16:58.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 前路何在 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ What comes then? ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:16:58.32,1:17:01.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 我清楚一切都 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ When it's clear that everything ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:17:01.05,1:17:05.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 再也回不到从前 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ Will never be the same again? ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:17:07.65,1:17:10.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 我会做出选择 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ Then I'll make the choice ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:17:10.86,1:17:13.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 听从内心的声音 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ To hear that voice ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:17:14.40,1:17:21.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 继续做正确的事 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ And do the next right thing ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:17:38.51,1:17:40.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,醒醒\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Wake up!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:43.51,1:17:46.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,快醒醒\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Wake up!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:05.66,1:18:06.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}That's it.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:07.37,1:18:09.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,快来抓我 快\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Come and get me! Come on!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:15.49,1:18:17.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Over here!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:19.47,1:18:21.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就对了 跟我来\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}That's right. Keep coming.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:21.95,1:18:23.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟我来\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Keep coming!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:30.21,1:18:31.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样能行\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}That'll work.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:31.51,1:18:33.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,来这边\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}This way, guys!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:43.53,1:18:44.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}What?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:45.57,1:18:48.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,不不不 她在把巨人引向水坝\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}No, no, no, no. She's leading them to the dam.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:58.26,1:18:59.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,克里斯托弗\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Kristoff!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:59.39,1:19:01.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来了 你有什么吩咐\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}I'm here. What do you need?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:01.09,1:19:02.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 去水坝 - 遵命\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}- To get to the dam. - You got it.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:02.94,1:19:03.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:19.72,1:19:21.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,快 快\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Come on. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:21.62,1:19:23.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 推我上去 - 我们绕过去找你\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}- Help me up! - We'll meet you around!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:27.87,1:19:29.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,马休中尉\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Lieutenant Mattias.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:29.07,1:19:31.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,陛下 您在做什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Your Highness, what are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:31.59,1:19:33.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,必须破坏水坝\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}The dam must fall.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:33.05,1:19:35.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有这样才能让迷雾散去 解救森林\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}It's the only way to break the mist and free the Forest.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:35.77,1:19:38.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我们发誓要不惜一切代价保护艾伦戴尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}But we've sworn to protect Arendelle at all costs.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:38.50,1:19:41.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们做出正确的选择 艾伦戴尔才有未来\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Arendelle has no future until we make this right.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:41.87,1:19:44.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,鲁纳德国王背叛了所有人\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}King Runeard betrayed everyone.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:45.23,1:19:46.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}How do you know that?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:46.75,1:19:49.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我姐姐舍命换来了真相\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}My sister gave her life for the truth.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:51.87,1:19:52.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,求你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Please.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:53.23,1:19:55.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要再有人牺牲了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Before we lose anyone else.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:17.58,1:20:18.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,小心\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Look out!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:26.04,1:20:28.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,毁了水坝 快\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Destroy the dam! Come on!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:28.11,1:20:30.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,把石头扔过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Throw your boulders.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:34.88,1:20:36.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}That's it.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:53.36,1:20:55.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我抓住她了 - 安娜\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}- I've got her! - Anna!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:55.60,1:20:56.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,坚持住\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Hang on!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:16.18,1:23:18.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉我抛下了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}I'm sorry I left you behind.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:19.16,1:23:21.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是太想保护她了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}I was just so desperate to protect her.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:21.65,1:23:23.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道 我知道 没关系\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}I know. I know. It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:24.84,1:23:26.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的爱没那么脆弱\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}My love is not fragile.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:30.43,1:23:32.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,快看天空\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Look at the sky.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:34.26,1:23:36.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我都不知道天空这么辽阔\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}I just didn't realize there was so much of it.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:37.08,1:23:39.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,三十四年\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}34 years…
Dialogue: 0,1:23:39.30,1:23:40.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,五个月\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Five months…
Dialogue: 0,1:23:40.64,1:23:43.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,零二十三天\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}And 23 days.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:54.07,1:24:55.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的是你吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Is it really you?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:56.04,1:24:57.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,安娜\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Anna.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:00.41,1:25:01.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以为我失去你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}I thought I'd lost you.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:01.79,1:25:03.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,失去我\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Lost me?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:03.21,1:25:05.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,你救了我 又一次\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}You saved me. Again.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:05.96,1:25:06.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}I did?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:07.00,1:25:10.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有安娜 艾伦戴尔没有淹没\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}And, Anna, Arendelle did not fall.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:12.13,1:25:13.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}It didn't?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:13.68,1:25:15.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,精灵们都同意了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}The spirits all agreed.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:15.60,1:25:18.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾伦戴尔理应与你同在\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Arendelle deserves to stand with you.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:20.39,1:25:21.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Me?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:21.19,1:25:24.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,你做了正确的事 为了所有人\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}You did what was right. For everyone.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:24.65,1:25:26.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你找到第五个精灵了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Did you find the fifth spirit?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:29.15,1:25:31.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就是第五个精灵\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}You are the fifth spirit.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:31.70,1:25:33.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就是那座桥梁\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}You're the bridge.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:33.16,1:25:35.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,事实上 桥有两头\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Well, actually, a bridge has two sides.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:35.87,1:25:38.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,而母亲有两个女儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}And Mother had two daughters.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:38.99,1:25:40.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们一起搭起了这座桥\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}We did this together.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:41.33,1:25:43.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们也会继续一起坚守\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}And we'll continue to do this together.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:44.92,1:25:45.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Together.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:45.92,1:25:48.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾莎 你没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Elsa! You're okay!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:51.76,1:25:53.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看起来变了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}You look different.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:53.26,1:25:54.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,你换了发型还是做了别的\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Did you cut your hair or something?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:55.30,1:25:56.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,做了别的\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Or something.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:00.68,1:26:03.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,安娜 我要问你一个问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Anna, I need to ask you a question.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:04.06,1:26:05.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,好\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:06.02,1:26:07.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想堆个雪人吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Do you want to build a snowman?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:08.73,1:26:09.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}What?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:22.58,1:26:25.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,幸亏水有记忆\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Thank goodness water has memory.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:38.43,1:26:39.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,安娜\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Anna.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:40.06,1:26:41.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾莎\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Elsa!
Dialogue: 0,1:26:42.14,1:26:44.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,克里斯托弗 还有斯文\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Kristoff! And Sven!
Dialogue: 0,1:26:45.10,1:26:47.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们都回来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}You all came back.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:47.61,1:26:50.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我好爱圆满结局\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}I love happy endings.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:50.73,1:26:52.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我猜我们是搞定了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}I mean, I presume we're done.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:52.28,1:26:54.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,还是说以后「置身死地」\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Or is this "putting us in mortal danger" situation.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:54.57,1:26:56.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,将成为家常便饭\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}gonna be a regular thing?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:56.95,1:26:58.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我们搞定了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}No. We're done.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:58.37,1:27:01.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,其实 还有一件事\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Actually, there is one more thing.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:01.95,1:27:02.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,安娜\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Anna,
Dialogue: 0,1:27:03.12,1:27:06.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是我见过最了不起的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}you are the most extraordinary person I've ever known.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:07.21,1:27:09.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我全心全意爱着你\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}I love you with all I am.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:10.29,1:27:11.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,你愿意嫁给我吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Will you marry me?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:13.59,1:27:14.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我愿意\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Yes!
Dialogue: 0,1:27:40.37,1:27:41.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾伦戴尔安全了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Arendelle's okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:41.78,1:27:42.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}What?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:44.08,1:27:46.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,亚托哈伦很美\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Ahtohallan is beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:47.67,1:27:48.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Hello.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:49.67,1:27:52.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,你属于这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}You know, you belong up here.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:53.34,1:27:56.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我曾发誓永远为艾伦戴尔着想\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}I took an oath to always do what's best for Arendelle.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:57.34,1:28:01.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,幸好 我知道该怎么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Luckily, I know just what that is.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:01.10,1:28:03.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,虽然我还是没搞懂「变幻之地」是什么意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}While I still don't know what "transformation" means…
Dialogue: 0,1:28:03.97,1:28:07.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我感觉这座森林真的改变了所有人\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}I feel like this Forest has really changed us all.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:12.90,1:28:15.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,有请女王陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Presenting Her Majesty,
Dialogue: 0,1:28:15.44,1:28:18.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾伦戴尔的安娜女王\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Queen Anna of Arendelle!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:24.87,1:28:27.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家好\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Hello. Hi.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:28.33,1:28:30.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯文 你打扮得真帅\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Sven, don't you look nice.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:31.21,1:28:33.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,天呐 雪宝\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Oh, my goodness! Olaf!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:33.25,1:28:35.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,可爱迷人\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Charmed, I'm sure.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:36.09,1:28:37.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,魅力四射\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Charming.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:37.30,1:28:38.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:40.47,1:28:41.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,克里斯托弗\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Kristoff.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:42.97,1:28:45.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们几个为了我好好打扮了一番吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Did you boys get all dressed up for me?
Dialogue: 0,1:28:45.06,1:28:46.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,是斯文的主意\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}It was Sven's idea.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:47.35,1:28:50.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,一小时 我们会为你保持一小时\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}One hour. You get this for one hour.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:50.19,1:28:51.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,没关系\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}That's okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:52.15,1:28:54.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,反正我更喜欢你穿皮衣\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}I prefer you in leather anyway.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:57.40,1:29:00.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,你居然能坚持一小时 太痛苦了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}I'm shocked you can last an hour. That was brutal.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:00.99,1:29:03.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就叫为爱付出\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}The things we do for love.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:03.37,1:29:05.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,你再说一遍这种疯狂魔法叫什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}What is this crazy magic called again?
Dialogue: 0,1:29:05.33,1:29:06.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,照片\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}A photograph.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:06.58,1:29:07.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,照片\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Photograph.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:08.58,1:29:09.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们真好看\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}We look good.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:10.00,1:29:12.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,赫利玛 马休将军\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Halima. General Mattias.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:12.17,1:29:13.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,陛下 我马上回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Your Majesty. I'll be right back.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:13.96,1:29:16.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不在的时候 你可以看我们的照片\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}You can look at our photograph while I'm gone.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:17.84,1:29:18.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我开玩笑的\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}I'm just kidding.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:18.67,1:29:21.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我表现得怎么样 - 棒极了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}- How am I doing? - Fantastic.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:29.27,1:29:33.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的土地和人民 终于被爱团结了\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Our lands and people, now connected by love.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:39.82,1:29:42.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,风灵 你喜欢吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Hi, Gale. You like it?
Dialogue: 0,1:29:43.07,1:29:46.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,帮个忙好吗 我给姐姐写了封信\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Do you mind? I've got a message for my sister.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:06.10,1:30:07.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:09.26,1:30:11.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,周五晚上的猜谜游戏别迟到\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}"Charades Friday night. Don't be late.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:12.06,1:30:14.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,别担心 艾伦戴尔一切都好\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}"And don't worry, Arendelle's doing just fine.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:14.73,1:30:16.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,继续守护森林\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}"Keep looking after the Forest.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:16.73,1:30:17.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我爱你\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}"I love you."
Dialogue: 0,1:30:18.61,1:30:20.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也爱你 妹妹\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}I love you, too, sis.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:20.73,1:30:24.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,风灵 我们要去兜风 一起去吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}Hey, Gale? We're going for a ride, wanna come?
Dialogue: 0,1:30:28.49,1:30:29.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,准备好了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}You ready?
Dialogue: 0,1:31:25.34,1:31:29.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 踏入未知 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ Into the unknown ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:31:29.34,1:31:33.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 踏入未知 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ Into the unknown ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:31:33.47,1:31:39.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 踏入未知 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ Into the unknown ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:31:42.36,1:31:45.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 我能听到你 但充耳不闻 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ I can hear you but I won't ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:31:46.03,1:31:49.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 有人惹事 有人求安 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ Some look for trouble while others don't ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:31:50.57,1:31:54.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 我有千万理由 继续平凡度日 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ There's a thousand reasons I should go about my day ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:31:54.62,1:31:59.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 并忽略你的低语 我盼望声音消失 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ And ignore your whispers which I wish would go away ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:32:06.63,1:32:08.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 你不是话语 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ You're not a voice ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:32:08.88,1:32:10.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 只是我耳中的鸣响 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ You're just a ringing in my ear ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:32:10.72,1:32:13.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 就算我能听见 我不承认 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ And if I heard you which I don't ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:32:13.31,1:32:15.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 恐怕我已有职责 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ I'm spoken for I fear ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:32:15.52,1:32:19.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 我的所爱之人都在高墙之内 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ Everyone I've ever loved is here within these walls ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:32:19.48,1:32:21.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 抱歉 神秘之声 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ I'm sorry, secret siren ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:32:21.19,1:32:23.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 但我要充耳不闻你的呼唤 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ But I'm blocking out your calls ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:32:23.61,1:32:25.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 我已乘风破浪 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ I've had my adventure ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:32:25.61,1:32:27.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 无需再多奇遇 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ I don't need something new ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:32:27.40,1:32:30.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 若我跟随你前行 风险令我不安 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ I'm afraid of what I'm risking if I follow you ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:32:30.95,1:32:34.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 踏入未知 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ Into the unknown ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:32:34.95,1:32:39.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 踏入未知 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ Into the unknown ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:32:39.21,1:32:44.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 踏入未知 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ Into the unknown ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:32:51.76,1:32:53.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 你想要如何 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ What do you want? ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:32:53.89,1:32:56.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 为什么不让我入睡 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ 'Cause you've been keeping me awake ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:32:56.31,1:33:00.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 你是为扰我心神不宁 让我因此犯错吗 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ Are you here to distract me so I make a big mistake? ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:33:00.06,1:33:04.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 或你真有其人 与我境遇相仿 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ Or are you someone out there who's a little bit like me? ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:33:04.69,1:33:08.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 内心深知这里不是我的归宿 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ Who knows deep down I'm not where I'm meant to be? ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:33:08.57,1:33:10.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 每天都愈加艰难 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ Every day's a little harder ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:33:10.61,1:33:12.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 我感知力量增长 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ As I feel your power grow ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:33:13.07,1:33:18.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 你是否知道我内心深处渴望 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ Don't you know there's a part of me that longs to go ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:33:18.12,1:33:22.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 踏入未知 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ Into the unknown ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:33:22.29,1:33:26.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 踏入未知 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ Into the unknown ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:33:26.34,1:33:32.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 踏入未知 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ Into the unknown ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:33:35.43,1:33:37.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 你存在吗 认识我吗 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ Are you out there? Do you know me? ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:33:37.35,1:33:42.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 感知我心 引领前路 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ Can you feel me? Can you show me? ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:33:58.29,1:34:02.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 你去哪里 别弃我而去 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ Where are you going? Don't leave me alone ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:34:02.25,1:34:07.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 我要如何跟随你 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ How do I follow you ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:34:07.71,1:34:19.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 踏入未知 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ Into the unknown ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:34:36.11,1:34:39.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 北风与海洋 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ Where the Northwind ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:34:39.24,1:34:42.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 交汇之处 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ Meets the sea ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:34:42.33,1:34:45.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 有条河流 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ There's a river ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:34:45.50,1:34:48.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 盈满记忆 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ Full of memory ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:34:48.63,1:34:53.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 睡吧 宝贝 酣然入梦 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ Sleep, my darling, safe and sound ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:34:53.30,1:34:57.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 在这条河里 一切皆明了 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ For in this river, all is found ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:34:58.14,1:35:01.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 一切皆明了 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ All is found ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:35:02.81,1:35:07.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 万物皆失之时 一切都将明了 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ When all is lost then all is found ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:35:07.60,1:35:10.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 她的河水 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ In her waters ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:35:10.73,1:35:13.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 深邃清澈 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ Deep and true ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:35:14.03,1:35:19.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 那里有你追寻的答案和方向 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ Lie the answers and a path for you ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:35:20.20,1:35:24.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 潜入河水深处 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ Dive down deep into her sound ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:35:24.96,1:35:29.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 但别太深 否则会溺亡 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ But not too far or you'll be drowned ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:35:30.59,1:35:35.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 她将为那些善听之人歌唱 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ She will sing to those who hear ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:35:35.97,1:35:43.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 她的歌里 魔法流淌 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ And in her song all magic flows ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:35:43.22,1:35:48.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 但你能否面对心之所惧 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ But can you brave what you most fear? ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:35:48.77,1:35:55.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 你能否正视河流所知的真相 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ Can you face what the river knows? ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:36:17.09,1:36:22.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 直到跨过河流 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ Until the river's finally crossed ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:36:22.64,1:36:29.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 你才能踏上坚实的土地 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ You'll never feel the solid ground ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:36:29.85,1:36:35.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 只有体会过迷失 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ You have to get a little lost ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:36:35.32,1:36:38.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 才能最终 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ On your way ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:36:38.40,1:36:41.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 找到自我 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ To being found ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:36:44.74,1:36:47.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 北风与海洋 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ Where the Northwind ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:36:47.91,1:36:51.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 交汇之处 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ Meets the sea ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:36:51.08,1:36:53.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 有位母亲 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ There's a mother ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:36:54.25,1:36:57.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 满腹回忆 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ Full of memory ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:36:57.26,1:37:01.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 来吧 宝贝 回到故乡 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ Come, my darling, homeward bound ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:37:02.01,1:37:05.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 万物皆失之时 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ Where all is lost ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:37:06.77,1:37:09.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 一切都将明了 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ Then all is found ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:37:10.02,1:37:13.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 一切皆明了 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ All is found ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:37:13.19,1:37:17.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 一切皆明了 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ All is found ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:37:35.63,1:37:37.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 你又一次离去 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ Again you're gone ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:37:39.01,1:37:42.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 走上和我不同的路途 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ Off on a diff'rent path than mine ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:37:42.26,1:37:44.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 我被留在原地 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ I'm left behind ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:37:44.01,1:37:48.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 不知是否应该追随 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ Wondering if I should follow ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:37:48.97,1:37:51.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 你不得不离去 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ You had to go ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:37:52.73,1:37:56.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 这当然没什么问题 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ And, of course, it's always fine ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:37:56.31,1:38:02.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 我也许明日便可追上你的步伐 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ I prob'ly could catch up with you tomorrow ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:38:02.74,1:38:09.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 可为何 我感觉与你日渐疏离 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ But is this what it feels like to be growing apart? ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:38:09.33,1:38:11.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 我从何时开始 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ When did I become the one ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:38:11.91,1:38:16.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 一刻不停在追赶你的心 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ Who's always chasing your heart? ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:38:16.00,1:38:18.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 如今我环顾四周 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ Now I turn around and find ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:38:18.67,1:38:22.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 却发现自己迷失于森林 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ I am lost in the woods ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:38:22.09,1:38:25.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 南北不分 左右不清 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ North is South, right is left ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:38:25.09,1:38:28.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 没有你便失去方向 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ When you're gone ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:38:28.47,1:38:31.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 本该由我护佑你回家 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ I'm the one who sees you home ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:38:31.22,1:38:35.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 而如今我却迷失于森林 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ But now I'm lost in the woods ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:38:35.35,1:38:40.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 也不知道你去向何方 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ And I don't know what path you are on ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:38:41.28,1:38:43.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 我迷失于森林 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ I'm lost in the woods ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:38:47.66,1:38:49.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 直至此刻 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ Up till now ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:38:49.95,1:38:54.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 我一直想着如何向你求婚 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ The next step was a question of how ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:38:54.25,1:38:59.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 从不需怀疑你我是否真正属于彼此 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ I never thought it was a question of whether ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:39:00.34,1:39:02.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 如果我不是你的真命天子 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ Who am I ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:39:04.17,1:39:07.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 那我又是谁 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ If I'm not your guy? ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:39:07.18,1:39:12.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 如果我们不能永远在一起 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ Where am I if we're not together? ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:39:12.77,1:39:15.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 我又该去向何方 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ Forever ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:39:15.81,1:39:18.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 现在我明白 你是我的北极星 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ Now I know you're my true North ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:39:18.52,1:39:22.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 因为我已迷失在这森林 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ 'Cause I am lost in the woods ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:39:22.03,1:39:24.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 你不在我身旁 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ Up is down, day is night ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:39:24.90,1:39:28.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 日夜颠倒 方寸大乱 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ When you're not there ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:39:29.37,1:39:31.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 你是我唯一的方向 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ You're my only landmark ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:39:31.70,1:39:35.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 我此刻迷失于森林 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ So I'm lost in the woods ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:39:35.75,1:39:40.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 不知你是否仍对我在意 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ Wondering if you still care ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:39:41.04,1:39:43.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 但我会等候 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ But I'll wait ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:39:44.59,1:39:47.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 等候一个启示 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ For a sign ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:39:47.50,1:39:50.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 让我知道自己是你的方向 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\b0}{\fs14}{\3c&H202020&}{\shad1}∮ That I'm your path ∮
